<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Tagin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">MARK gv Gamlv milambv</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mk</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARK</para>
  <para style="mt2">gv Gamlv Milambv</para>
  <para style="imt">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Mark gv Gamlv milambv</char> vbv minrapdu “Si Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo akin, Jisu Kristo gv Alvnv Yunying ngv.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Jisunyi Pwknvyarnv gv tojupkunam a okv rinamvngnama gvla rinv vngnv nyi gubv kaatamdo. Ninyia Pwknvyarnv gv tolwk nama ninyigv tamsarnam lokv kaatamdo, ninyigv jwkrw v uyuvram vdwa doolv yakunam, okv nyi vdwgv rimur vdwa mvngnga jikunam. Jisu atubongv nyi Kuunyilo gobv minsuto, Nw aalaku atugv svngtung ham mvngnga tokula okv nyi vdwa rimur lokam naalin jikunv.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark, Jisu gv higu sum mindakala rungbv, rilagvnv gobv minjito, Jisu ninyigv gamchar lokv tamsarnam mumse nga, ninyigv rinamvngnam alvyanv gubv kaatamdo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jon Baptist gv lvkwng nga, okv Jisu gv baptisma naanam okv Jisunyi pokayarka kunam, um achukgo kaatamro kochingbv, sum lvknv si Jisu gv mvpuripu nam okv tamsarkinu nama baapubv kaatamyado. Aluayuv vngya yayaku Jisu gv rigvnam vdwv ninyigv lvkwng nga alvyabv chinya toku. Vbvritola Jisunyi nyirunv vdwv abuyabv haak yayato. Minya nvbv mvrwmvpa vdw so Jisu gv nyia mooku so rinyadw alu am, ninyia daapo lo takki kunam a pwbwng alvbv, okv turkurkunama minpa jido.</para>
  <para style="ip">Gamlv sokv lvknyanam lvga so mirinyi, mvrwnam gv arwng soka doonv gaam vdw sum Mark lvknya yaku mabv, kvvbi gunv lwknya pvku nvgo vla kam mindu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arwng lokv darlinnam</para>
  <para style="io1">Gamlv nga mintumingke bv minrap kunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galili lo Jisu nyi apumlo gamlv mingo karnam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-9:50">1:14—9:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galili lokv Jerusalem lo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10:1-52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ataranya lo okv Jerusalem gv nvchilo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-15:47">11:1—15:47</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jisu gv turkurkunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">16:1-8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Turkurkunv Ahtu gv kaatamsikunam okv ao bv chaakunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16:9-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Jon baptist gv japgo karnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mt 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Si Pwknvyarnv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo domado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pwnvyarnvgv kuunyilo. </char></note> gv kuunyilo, Jisu Kristo gv Alvnv Yunying ngv <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref> </char></note> Si nyijwk Aijaya gv lvkpv kunam aingbv rirap toku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Pwknvyarnv minto, ‘Ngo ngoogv gindungpingko nga nonu gvlo vngcho more</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">nw nonugv lvgabv lamtv nga mvko jire.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Aij 40:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chukrimooku lo nyi go gokdungdo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Ahtu gv vngku lvgabv lamtv nga sorchi dvbv pacho laka!’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Vkvlvgabv Jon chukrimooku lo aalwkto, baptisma jitoku okv Japkar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jon chukrimooku lo aawkto baptisma jito okv japkarto; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jon Baptist chukrimooku lo aalwkto okv japkarto</char></note> toku. “Nonu rimur lokv lintokuka okv baptisma naalakuka,” Nw mintoku nyi vdwa, “Okv Pwknvyarnv nonugv rimur a mvngnga jiriku.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Judia mooku lokv okv Jerusalem pamtv lokv nyi achialvgo Jon gv minam a tvvbv linlaku bunu atubogv rimur a mintam jilaku Jon gvlo Jordan svko lo baptisma jiku toku.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2Dv 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jon Kemel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kemel si chukrimooku lo rinv kainv svnwng</char></note> gv amw lokv chumnam vji a kooto okv ninyigv kipo lo apin hook go hokto okv ninyigv dvnam v takamyarup okv mootum gv tangu-ngula. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Nw nyi vdwa minpa jito, “Ngoogv kochinglo ngam kaiyanvgo aare ngo ninyigv lvsup a choobap la taasok yadubvka alvka yama. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Ngo nonua isi lokv mwng baptisma jidu, vbvritola nw nonua Darwknv Dow lokv baptisma jireku.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu baptisma naanam okv pokayarkanam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mt 3:13—4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lk 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Ayungjvma nga Jisu Galili mookugv Najaret lokv aalaku, Jordan svko lo Jon gvlokv baptisma jiku toku. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Jisu isi lokv daklin sopikda, nw kaapato nyidomooku v kokok dubv okv Dow v taakw jvbv nw gvlo holwk dubv kaato. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Atk 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Miri 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Aij 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mk 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref> </char></note> Okv ho nyidomooku lokv gaamgo gokto “No ngoogv pakyachoknam kuunyilo akin v, nam lvkobv ngo mvngpu dukunv.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Vjakgobv Darwknv Dow hv ninyia chukrimooku lo vngdubv mvto, <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>hoka nw alu champigo dookunamv, mootum lo Uyu ngv ninyia pookayarka toku. Hoka svnwngsvmin vka dooto, vbvrikunamv nyidogindung vdwv aatoku okv ninyia ridur toku.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ngui naanv nyi api go goklin toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-24">Mt 4:12-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lk 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Jonnyi patwk tumlwkro kochinglo, Jisu Galili mookulo vngla okv Pwknvyarnv lokv Alvnv Yunying nga japkar toku. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mt 3:2</ref> </char></note> “Alvnv alu v aadukukv,” nw minto, “Okv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv nvchi dukukv rimur lokv lintokuka okv Alvnv Yunying nga mvngjwng tvka!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Jisu Galili gv svparsvlv lvgumlo vngkar rikulo, ngui naanv nyi anyigo nw kaapato, Saimon okv ninyigv boru Andriu, vsap lokv ngui naadungto. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Jisu bunua mintoku, “Ngam lvkobv aato, okv ngo nonua nyi naadubv tamsarre.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Vjakgobv bunu vsap a topu pikula okv ninyia lvkobv vngtoku.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Nw achukgo vnglindvda hoka boru anyi godv kaapa toku, Jebedi gv kuunyilo Jems okv Jon bunyia. Bunu bunugv svpw arwnglo vsap a mvdinla dootoku. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Jisu bunua kaapa namgola nw bunua gokto; ho bunu bunugv abu Jebedi okv riria jinv bunua svpw lo doomupila okv Jisunyi lvkobv vngtoku.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyi akolo alvmanv dow go dootoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Lk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv Kaparnaum banggu lo aatoku, okv akonvgv Jius Doonualu lo Jisu Jius kumkunaam lo vngtoku okv tamsar rapto. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mt 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref> </char></note> Nyi vdwv ninyigv tamsar nama tvvla lamrwpanyato, oglvgavbolo nw pvbv tamsarnvbv mimabv tojupkunam jvbv tamsar yato.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Vjakgobv bunugv Jius kumkunaamlo ho alvmanv dow v nyi ako gvlo aakunamv nw gamtv rungbv segokto, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>“Najaret gv Jisu No ngonu gvlo ogugo naadubv? No ngonua soka mvyakmvchak dvbvri? Ngo chindu no yvvdw—No Pwknvyarnv gv darwknv gindungpingko ngv!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Jisu gamki la dow a minto “Mimabvk, no nyi lokv liro tokuk!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>alvmanv dow v ho nyi ham achirungbv hwkdin moto okv gamtv rungbv segok moto, okv nyi lokv lintoku. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Nyi mvnwngngv achialvbv lamrwpanya lakula akin-akin v mirwk minsu raptoku, “Si ogu goda? Si re jvjvbv ogu gonyi anw bv tamsarnamv? So nyi angv si tojupkunam go nw alvmanv dow vdwaka kaanam namla do okv bunuka ninyia tvvjidu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Okv vkvlvgabv Jisu gv lvkwng yunying ngv Galili gv mooku mvnwnglo baapu bv dupwng toku.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyi achialvgo mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mt 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv Jems okv Jon bunyia mintala, Jius kumkunaam ha kayupila okv vngdavngrala Saimon okv Andriu gv naamlo vnglwkto. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Saimon gv ayu gadw lo ramla lvvmala dooto, Jisu aachi sopikda, bunu ninyia hvkvgv lvgabv minjito. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Jisu ninyigvlo aato, laak lokv gakbwngto, okv ninyia ridurla dakrap dubv svyinto. Ramnam hv nw lokv ngetoku, okv nw bunua jiraphorap toku.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Doonyi v poklwkro kochingbv ariumrikulo hoka nyi vdwv lvvmanv mvnwngnga okv vram naanam nyi vdwa Jisu gvlo aagvjito. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Banggu hokv nyi mvnwngngv aakumla naam agi lo dakpamto. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Jisu awgo nvgwngnv lvvma nvnga mvpujito okv awgo uyuvram haka chara jito. Nw uyuvram vdwa gaam milin momato, ogulvgavbolo bunu chinsuto nw yvvdw.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Galili lo japgo kartoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Lk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Aru gonvgv arukamchi bv puaharing madvbv kanv dvdubv, Jisu gudungla okv naam lokv vngtoku. Nw banggu ha vngboto jimiku mooku golo, hoka nw kumto. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Vbvritola Saimon la ninyigv ajin vdwv vnglinto Jisunyi makarbv, <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>okv vdwlo bunu nw a kaapa tokudw bunu minto, “Mvnwng hv nam kaakardu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Vbvrinamv Jisu mirwksito, “Ngonu vngrung laju kvvbi dokardovr nampum vdw soka. Ngo bunugv lvgabv japtam jidubv, ogulvgavbolo ngo hvkv lvgabv aapvnv.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mt 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9:35</ref> </char>
    </note> Vkvlvgabv nw Galili mookulo mvnwngnga vnggola okv ho vdwgv Jius vdwgv kumkunaamlo mingojito okv uyuvram vdwa charkak jito.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyi ako mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mt 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Apin hv yaarikla arwnam lvvmanv nyi go Jisu gvlo aato, lvbwng ngv kumpvto, okv mvdur lvgabv ninyia dinchi rungbv koto. “No mvnggilo,” nw minto, “No nga darwk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">darwk dubv mvto </char><char style="ft" closed="false">So lvvma si nyi a darwk madubv mvnvgo. </char></note> dubv mvlare.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Jisu aya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">haachi</char></note> mvngpato, okv ninyigv laak v ilindola nyi ham mambwngto. “Ngo mvnggidu,” nw mirwk toku. “Darwk tokuka!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Vjakgobv nyi agv lvvma ngv ngetoku, okv nw darwk toku. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Vbvrinamv Jisu ninyia kadwk rungbv minto okv ninyia vjakgobv vngmu toku <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Leb 14:1-32</ref> </char></note> ninyia “Tvvtoka, so gv rinam sum yvvnyika mintam mabvka,” vla mingv rikula. “Vbvritola nyibu gvlo vngdavngra laka okv ninyia no jwngkadaka kolaka; hvbv rigvrila nyichar mvnwngnga no poorung pvku vla chimu laka, Moses gv ortojinam lokv erinpeelwk a rinto laka.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Vbvritola nyi angv vngtoku okv minrap toku Yunying nga mooku mvnwnglo dupwng motoku. Nw vbv achialvbv minkunamv Jisu ka banggu lo nyi ha kaapa kodubv vngnyu kumato. Vmabvya, nw agumlo jemataiku mookulo dootoku, okv mooku mvnwng gv nyi vdwv nw gvlo aakumto.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu digwngnv nyi ako mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mt 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Alu lonyi loom gv kochinglo Jisu kaparnaum lo vngkur toku, okv ho nw naam lo doopvkv vla yunying ngv dusik toku. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Vkvlvgabv hoka nyi vdwv achialvbv aakum kunamv aronv karchung goka dooku mato, okv agi gv agum loka dooku kaamato. Jisu bunua doin japjito. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Vdwlo nyi api v aalwk tokudw, digwngnv nyi go Jisu gvlo joolwk toku. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Nyi twngtv kunam lvgabv, ogubvrijeka, bunu nyi um ninyi gvlo aagv nyumato. Vkvlvgabv Jisu ogolo doopvdw ho tintwbv bunu namwng aolo ungko go mvko toku. Vdwlo bunu mvko tokudw bunu nyi a ninyigv joko lo karmu tvla soolu jitoku. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Bunugv achialvbv mvngjwng kunam a kaagv rikula, Jisu digwngnv nyi anga minto, “Ngoogv kuunyilo, noogv rimur vdwa mvngnga jipvkun.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Pvbv tamsarnv megonv ho vdwv doodum tvla bunu mvngsu nyato, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Ogubv so nyi si svbv gaam minladunv? Si Pwknvyarnvnyi nyarjitari namgo! Pwknvyarnv akin mwng yvvdw rimur ham mvngnga ladunv!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Vjakpi gobv Jisu chintoku ho vdwgv ogugo mvngnam am, vkvlvgabv nw bunua minto, “Ogubv nonu vbv mvngdunv? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Vbvri minpubv minla, so digwngnv nyi sum, ‘No gv rimur vdwa mvngnga pvkunv,’ vmalo mindubai, ‘Gudunglak, naaraplak noogv karpunvnv nga, okv vngkarto’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Vbvrijvka Nyia Kuunyilo ngv nyiamooku so rimur ham anyubv kayu jidubv tojupkunamv doodu hum ngo kaatam dubv rinam go.” Vkvlvgabv nw digwngnv nyi a minto. <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Ngo nam mindu, dakrap tvkuka, naaraplak noogv karpunvnv nga, okv naam lo vngnyikuka!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Vbvririlo ho mvnwngngv kaadumto, nyi angv dakrap laku, ninyigv karpunvnv nga naarap toku, okv baapubv vngtoku. Bunu mvnwngngv lamngaknyato okv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvla, minto, “Ngonu vdwloka svkvnvgo ogugoka kaakw mapvnv!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Lebinyi goktoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mt 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Jisu Galili svparsvlv adarlo lvkodv aakur toku. Nyitwng go nw gvlo aakumto, okv nw bunua tamsar rapto. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Nw vbv vngrilo, nw kaapato lampu naakumyanv, Lebi Alpius gv kuunyilo, ninyigv opislo dooto. Jisu ninyia minto, “Nga vngming gvto.” Lebi gudungto okv nw a vngming gvtoku.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Kochinglo Jisu Lebi gv naamlo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Lebi gv naam lo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ninyigv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Hv Jisu gv) naam.</char></note> dvnam dvla dooto. Twngtv rungnv lampu naakumyanv okv toa kunam nyi vdwvka Jisunyi vngming gvto, okv ninyi gvlo megonv aapwngto okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv tvbul adarlo dooto. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Pvbv tamsarnv nyi mego, Parisis nyi vdwv, Jisunyi lampu naakumyanv vdwa okv toa kunam nyi vdwa lvkobv dvdubv kaapato, vkvlvgabv bunu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa tvuto, “Ogubv nw vkvnv nyi vdwa lvkobv dvdunv?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Jisu bunuam tvvpato okv mirwkto, “Nyi ngv yvvbunudw chvrv nvngv Daktor a dinchima, vbvritola yvvbunudw lvvmanvngv mwng. Ngo mvngdvnv nyi vdwa gokbv aamato, vbvritola rimurnv vdwa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiknam lvkwng nga tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mt 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Doopam gulo Jon gv rigvnam vdwv la okv Parisis vdwv bunu yikla doonyato. Nyi megonv Jisu gvlo aato okv ninyia tvuto, “Si ogu vdw Jon gv lvbwlaksu vdwv la okv Pharisis gv lvbwlaksu vdwv yikla doogvre, vbvritola no gvngv dooma dunv?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Nonuno nyidalo doonv vdwa dvmatvngma bv vngmu dukubv dvmin dunvre? Hvbv rirung mare! Makbu v doodv dvbv bunuam, bunu hvbv rimare. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Vbvritola alu go aariku makbu a bunugv loka vnggv roriku, okv vbvrikubolo bunu ho yigrap reku.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>“Yvvka vji jenw ariap ham vji jikulo hamtak lwknv kaama; Vbvrikubolo ninyigv jenw hamlwk namv takche rikunyi takgv riku okv ungko ngv kootv yayare. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Yvvka anggor ala anw ham pumchup akulo pwlwknv kaamare; vbvribolo anggor ala anw ngv pumchup aku lo hupokre, okv anggor ala ngvla pumchup v alv mariku. Vmabvya anggor ala anw a pumchup anw lo pwlwk yadunv.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jius doonualu lvkwngbv tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mt 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Det 23:25</ref> </char>
    </note> Jius Doonualu golo Jisu radv rongo apum gulo vngpitla vngto. Nw gv lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv vngming gvto, bunu radv damw dooku ham gakbwngla pikrap nyatoku. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Vkvlvgabv Parisi vdwv Jisunyi minto, “Kaato laka, noogv lvbwlaksu vdwv jius Doonualu lo vbvrinam si ngonugv Pvbv nga rinyingdu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Nonu Dabid vdwlo dvnam go dvnwng rilo ogugo ribvdw um nonuno lvkoka puri rikw mai? Nw la okv ninyigv nyi vdwv kano toku, <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Leb 24:9</ref> </char></note> hoka nw vngtoku Pwknvyarnv gv naamlo okv dvtoku Pwknvyarnv gvlo kumlwknam vtwng nga. Svbvrito vdwlo Abiatar nyibu butvyachok bv ririlo. Ngonugv Pvbv ara lokv nyibu vmwng vtwng nga dvnyu nvngv—vbvritola Dabid um dvtoku okv ninyigv nyi vdwaka jita toku.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Okv Jisu minya toku, “Nyi si Doonualu lvgabv mvvma; Doonualuv nyi gv alvnam lvgabv mvpvnv; <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Vkvlvgabv Nyia Kuunyilo ngv Doonualu gvka Ahtu hv.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Nyi ako laak gonv lakpik nvgo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mt 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Vbvritola Jisu lvkodv Jius kumkunaamlo aato kuring, ho hoka nyi go dooto hv laak v lakpik nvgo. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Hoka Jisunyi rimur nvgobv vla minjinv nyi mego toyala dooto; Vbv bunu Jisunyi nyi anga Jius Doonualu lo mvpu ridw vla kaagapla doyato. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Jisu nyi anga minto, “Aatoka kaagia so.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Vbvritola nw tvuto nyi vdwa, “Ogugo ngonugv Pvbv ngv rimudunv Jius Doonualulo? Ridur dubvri vmalo ridur madubvri? Nyi gv singdung nga ringdubvri vmalo ngoomu dubvri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Vbvritola bunu oguka minkuma. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Jisu haachila bunuam kaitto, vbvritola vjakgobv nw bunua aya mvngpa toku, ogulvgavbolo bunuv achialvbv vlwnghapok bv gvvnyadu okv rimur nyadu. Vbvrikunamv nw minto nyi anga, “Noogv laak v laklinto.” Nw laklinjito, okv hv lvkodv alvtoku. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Vkvlvgabv Parisis vdwv Jius kumkunaam lokv lintoku okv Herod gv nyi vkv lvkobv kaarwksuto, okv bunu Jisunyi mvkidubv rungrap toku.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Svpar lo nyitwng go</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv Galili gv svparsvlv lo vngtoku, okv kairungnv nyitwng go ninyia vngming gvto. Ho vdwv Galili lokv aatoku, Judia lokv, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Jerusalem lokv, Idumia mooku lokv, Jordan svko chaagu takdv lokv, okv mooku dokarku Taire okv Sidon Pamtv lokv. So nyi mvnwngngv Jisu gvlo aato ogulvgavbolo bunuv ninyigv rinam a tvvpato. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mk 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lk 5:1-3</ref></char></note> Nyitwng v achialvbv twngtvto ho Jisu minto ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa svpw ako ninyigv lvgabv naapv jidubv, vkvlvgabv ho nyi vdwv ninyia chapma dubv. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Nyi achialvgo nw mvpu kunamv, okv lvvmanv mvnwngngv nw gvlo aala mvsit dubv vla nvngpin nvngyin minsula aanyato. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Okv vdwlo alvmanv dow gvnv nyi vdwv ninyia kaapa tokudw, bunu ninyigv kaagialo guplwkla okv goklinto, “No rung Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Jisu alvmanv dow vdwa nw yvvdw um yvvnyika minpa mabvkv vla kadwk rungbv mintoku.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu vring gola anyia Apostol gubv darlin toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mt 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu yvvnyi vnggvnvpv mvngpvdw goklaila moodw putung golo chaato. Bunu hoka nw gvlo aato, <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Okv nw darlinto vring gola anyigo, yvvnyi nw Apostol vla amin minpvdw. “Ngo nonua darlin pvnv nga lvkobv ridubv,” Nw bunua minto. “Ngo ka nonua agumlo japdubv vngmure, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>okv nonu gvlo uyuvram vdwa charkak nvnv jwkrw v doore.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>So vring gola anyi si ninyigv darlinnam: Saimon (Jisu Pitar vla ninyia amin minto); <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Jebedi gv kuunyilo Jems okv ninyigv boru Jon (Bunuam Jisu Boanarjes vla amin minto, vnam si “Doogumbv rinv nyi v”); <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andriu, Pilip, Bartolomiu, Metiu, Tomas, Alpius gv kuunyilo Jems, Tadius, Saimon Ringrianv <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>Okv Judas Iskeriot, yvvdw Jisunyi koanv.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Biljebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mt 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu naam vngtoku. Lvkodv nyi twngtv rungnvgo aakumto ho Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv dvdw doomato. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Vdwlo ninyigv lvga nga vpin v hum tvvpapvdw, bunu ninyia naatung dubv rito, ogulvgavbolo nyi vdwv minto, “Nw suru duku!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char>
    </note> Pvbv tamsarnv mego Jerusalem lokv aala minto, nw gv arwnglo Biljebul doopv! So si uyuvram vdwgv dvbv ngv yvvdw nw a gwlwk jigvrila bunuam agumlo chara dubv jwkrw jipv nvgo.<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu bunuam nw gvlo goklwkto okv bunuam minchisinam go minto: “Oguaingbv Uyu ngv atubonga chara nyudubv? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Mooku gonv yakpin sisula v pami sikubolo hv yagiak reku. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Vpin gonv yakpin sisula vpin akonyi pami sikubolo, v vpin v yagiak reku. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Vkvlvgabv uyu gv karv ngv apumbv yakpin sikubolo, v vdwloka hvngdwng mare, vbvrikubolo yagiak reku okv ala ngeriku.”<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>“Gwlwknv nyi a leepv choma bolo yvvka hvkvgv naam a mvkola aala oguogua naanyu mare; leepv chobo lomwng naam loka naala vnggv nyure.”<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>“Ngo nonua jvjvbv mindu, nyi vdwgv rimur mimur rinam mvnwng okv Pwknvyarnv nyika ogu minyingminchu milin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bunugv alvmanv bv minam; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bunugv Pwknvyarnvnyi minyingminsu minam.</char></note> nama mvngnga nyudunv; <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Lk 12:10</ref></char></note> Vbvritola yvvnyiv Darwknv Dow a minyingminchu nvnga vdwloka mvngnga nyumare, oglvgavbolo nw doobwngnv rimur a ripv.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>(Jisu gv sum minam si ogulvgavbolo nyi twnggonv, “Nw gvlo darwkmanv dow v doodu” vnam lvgabv.)<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv anv okv boru vdwv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mt 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Vbvrinamv Jisu gv, anv la okv boru vdwv vngchito. Bunu naam gv agumlo dakto okv ninyia tvvkarla gaam gamgo milwkto. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Hoka nyitwng go Jisunyi dookarto, okv bunu ninyia minto, “kaalak, noogv anv okv noogv boru vdwv okv noogv bormv vdwv agum v bunu nam dinchipv.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Jisu mirwk suto, “Yvv bunula ngoogv anv ngv? Yvv bunula ngoogv boruv?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Ninyia dokarnv nyi mvnwngnga nw kaitkarto okv minto, “Kaato! Si bunu ngoogv anv okv boru vdwv! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Yvvbunudw Pwknvyarnv gv mvnglwkbv ridunv hv bunu ngoogv anv, ngoogv bormv, boruv.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Amw chinv lo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mt 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lk 5:1-3</ref> </char>
    </note> Lvkodv Jisu Galili Svparsvlv adarlo tamsar rapto. Nw a ho dokarnv nyitwng v achialvbv twngtvto vkvlvgabv nw svpw arwnglo chaala dooto. Svpw v arwng kiambv vnglinto, okv nyitwng v dakto isi sidar biyagilo. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Nw bunua awgo tamsar dvla minchisinam vkv minvla minjito:<verse eid="MRK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Tvvto! Kvvlo nyi ako dooto nw radv chibv vnglinto. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Vdwlo nw amw vdwa rongolo chiak rapto kudw, kvgonv lamtvlo olinpvto, okv pvta vdwv aala okv hum dvtoku. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Kvgonv lvngtak lo holula hopvto, hoka kvdw achakgo dooto. Amw v ainbv boklin toku ogulvgavbolo kvdw v rungrwng mato. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Agar miami v rungrwngbv harlwkku kaama laila vbvrinamv, vdwlo doonyi v chaalin tokudw agar a kaayok toku; okv ogulvgavbolo miami v rungrwngbv kvdwlo aamato, agar v baapubv sintoku. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Kvgonv tvv apumlo holwkto, v singtoku okv agar a yuptoku, okv bunu oguka dape peelin mato. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Kvgonv hooluto kvdw alvyaung kolo, okv agar v baapubv garlinto, singto, okv dape peelin toku: kvgonv dasum chaam go kvgonv chamkv, okv kvgonv lwngbv.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Okv Jisu minya toku, “Vbvrinamv, nonuno nyarung doodu nvlo, tvvtoka!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minchisinam gv lvkwng ngv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mt 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Vdwlo Jisu akin tokudw ninyigv minam a tvvnv nyi kvgonv bunu lvbwlaksu vring gola anyi gv lvkobv aala ninyia minchisinama minbwk jilabvkv vtoku. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Pwknvyarnv gv rungrwng rungnv Karv gv lvkwng nga nonua jiroku. Vbvritola kvvbinyi vdwv, ogumvnwng nga minchisinam lokv tvvdunv, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Aij 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref></char></note> vkvlvgavbolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Bunu kaadv-kaadv la kaare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">vbvrijvka kaapa mare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">okv tvvdv-tvvdv la tvvre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">vbvrijvka tvvchin mare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Vkvlvgavbolo bunu chinv guilo bunu Pwknvyarnvnyi dakrwk dukunvpv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">okv nw bunua mvngnga jidu kunvpv.’”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu amw chinv minchisinama minbwk jito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mt 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Vbvrinamv Jisu bunuam tvvkato, “Nonu minchisinam sum chimadunvri? Vbvrikubolo nonu oguaingbv kvvbi minchisinam go chindubv? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Amw paknv Pwknvyarnv gv doin a pakje jito. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Kvgonv nyi v ho lamtvlo amw hosoknam jvbv; bunuv baapubv doin a tvvdasopitda, Uyu ngv aareku okv hung naala vnggvreku. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Kvgonv nyi v amw v lvngtak aolo hopvnam jvbv. Bunuv baapubv doin tvvdasopitda bunu himpula hum tvvrwksito. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Vbvritola bunulo rungrwngbv aalwk manam lvgalo, okv bunu vdwloka hvngdwng mare vkvlvgabv vdwlo adwkaku v vmalo mvdwkmvku v aarikudw doin lvga lokv, bunu vjakgobv kayudariku. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Kvgunv nyi v tvv hvdwnglo amw holwk nam jvbv rido. So vdw sinv yvv doin ham tvvdunv, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>vbvritola mvngrudu so singse lvgabv, nyitv lvgabv pakyado, okv nvgwng a mvngbiula nyitwng arwnglo okv doin a ngemu duku, okv bunu asi svlin kumanv. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Vbvritola kvgonv nyi v alvnv kvdw lo amw paknam jvbv rito. Bunu doin a tvvgapto, hung tvvrwksito, okv asi svlinto: kvgonv chaam bv, kvgonv chamkvbv, okv kvgonv lwngbv.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvdurupum ako bati kyampwk lo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Lk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lk 11:33</ref></char>
    </note>Jisu minbwngto, “Nyi akonv mvdurrupum ako naalwkla okv hum bati kyampwk takmamla vmalo gadw gv kyampwk lo vvpv dvnvri? Hum tunggingnvnv gv aolo nw vvpv madunvri? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mt 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lk 12:2</ref></char></note> Ogugo vvsi pvdw hum agumlo bvnglinla mvko riku, okv ogugo takmam pvkudw v takmam kumare. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Vbvrinamv, tvvto nonuno nyarung doodu nvlo!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mt 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Lk 6:38</ref></char>
    </note> Nw bunua lvkodv mindvto, “Alvbv tvvgapto ogugo no tvvpvdw! Ogu kiinvnv lokv no nyi ham jwngkadaka dvdw vbv kiinvnv lokv Pwknvyarnv ka nam jwngkadaka—vbvritola humka kaiyanvgo rire. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mt 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:9">25:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lk 19:26</ref></char></note> Nyi v yvvdw ogugo doodudw hum kaiyago jire okv nyi v yvv ogugoka domapvdw vkvgvlo achukgo doonam haka naarit reku.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amw garnvlo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Jisu minbwngto, “Pwknvyarnv gv karv ngv svbv rido. Nyi akonv ninyigv rongolo amw paklwkkto. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Nw ayulo yuptoku, alu dukubv v gudung toku, okv vbvririlo amw mvnwngngv boksula okv garrap toku. Vjvka um nw oguaingbv ridu nvdw um chinkuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Kvdw v atubongv singnv a singmusido okv asi a svlin mosudo. Atukchochukbv radvdada ngv, okv danv ngv, okv ataranyabv dape mvnwng a kaapado. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Jol 3:13</ref></char></note> Vdwlo radv ngv kamkubolo, nyi v parap toku hum ninyigv rioktung lokv, ogulvgavbolo rongo mvdw dw v aatoku.<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yingmw lo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mt 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>“Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv svbv rido vla ngonu oguaingbv minsedw?” Jisu tvuto. “Ngonu hum ogugonyi minchisinvla minbwk jidubv? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>So si svbv ridu. Nyi akonv yingmw go naato, nyiamooku gv amw charching yachoknv, okv um kvdwlo lvvlwk toku. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Ayungjvma nga v singcha toku okv singnv mvnwngnga kaiyachok nvgobv ritoku. Hv hakbv ngv vbv kairungbv harlin toku ho pvta ngv aala bunugv asup vdwa ho gv doonyum lo suplwk toku.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Jisu ninyigv doina nyi vdwlo japjito, mintaknvto awgo kvvbi minchisinam sibe minvla; nw mintamto bunua vkamgo bunu tvvchin nyodudw. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Nw ogugoka mimato bunua minchisinam mintak mabv, vbvritola vdwlo nw akinpvdw lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv, nw ogumvnwng nga bunua minbwk jitoku.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu dooridoogum a mvtor toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mt 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Ho alu akin gv arium hoka, Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Klai svparsvlv takdv gonv durap linlaju.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu nyitwng nga vngyu toku; lvbwlaksu vdwv Jisu gv doolwkku svpw lo aalwk mingvto, okv bunu ninyia bunugv lvkobv vnggv toku. Kvvbi svpw vdwvka hoka dooto. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Dvminmabv kairungbv doori v rirapto, okv sikiok v svpw arwnglo kioklwkto, vkvlvgabv isi v hoka yarbing tvvtoku. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Jisunyi svpw arwng gv koching kiambv dooto, nw domtom golo dumpo ngv dumpv tola yupminto. Lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia muuto okv minto, “Tamsarnv, no ngonua mvngpa kumare ngonu sida jiku nvlaka?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Jisu dakrapto okv dooria mintoku, “Choibv dooto!” Okv nw minto sikiok aka, “Doochingbv dooto!” Doori v ringin toku, hoka kairungbv jematai toku. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Ogubv nonu busu nyadunv? Vjaklodvbv nonu nga mvngjwng malare?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Vbvritola bunu achialvbv busuto okv akonv akonyi mimisito, “Yvvla so nyi si? Doori vla sikiok hvka ninyia tvvdu!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Alvmanv dow vdwgv naanam nyi go Jisu mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mt 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv vngchi toku Gerasa mookugv Galili svparsvlv takdvlo, <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Vdwlo Jisu svpw lokv korlin sopikda nw kaapato nyigo hv nyibung bungpam hoka lvngpwk lokv linvgo. So nyi si alvmanv dow gvnvgo. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Okv nyibung bungpam lo doonvgo yvvka ninyia rwngja ngv vdwloka leepv nyumato; <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Vdwnvgo ninyigv lvpa okv laak a leepv kwtoku, vbvritola leeri gv dwkibv nw rvngja nga dokpwkla mvmwkmvmakto ninyigv lvpa gv riokdar haka. Nw achialvbv gwlwkrongto yvvka ninyia naatung nyumato. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Alu okv ayubv nw nyibung bungpam lo vngkarto okv moodw lokv, segok karto okv vlwng ngv atua tupsuto.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Nw mego aduto vdwlo Jisunyi kaapa tokudw; vkvlvgabv nw joklwk toku, ninyigv kaagialo lvbwng ngv kumpvla, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Okv gamtvrongbv segokto, “Jisu, Kaiyachoknv Pwknvyarnv gv kuunyilo! No ngoogvlo ogugo mvngdu? Pwknvyarnv gv amin bv, nam ngo koodunv, nga mvrit mabvka!” (<verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Nw svbv minto ogulvgavbolo Jisu mintoku, “Alvmanv dow, so nyi sokv liro tokuka!”)<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu ninyia tvvkato, “No gv aminv ogu vla?” Nyi angv mirwkto, “Ngoogv aminv ‘(Mob)’ nyitwng—ho ngonu twngtv nvgo!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Okv nw Jisunyi alvmanv dow vdwa ho mooku loka adu lo vngmu mabvka vla kodwkkrwkla koola minto.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Hoka kairungbv vrik riktwng go moodw nvchi hoka dvla reto. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Vkvlvgabv dow v Jisunyi kooto, “Ngonua riktwng alo vngmulabvka, okv ngonua bunu gvlo aalwk molabvka.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Jisu bunua vngmuto, okv alvmanv dow v ho nyi lokv lintoku okv riktwnglo aalwk toku. Riktwng mvnwngngv lvngring anyi dvsegobv vrik v rito-chapchar minsula svparsvlv kiambv taraklo holula okv svparsvlv arwngbv holwk toku.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Vrik ka kaayanv vdwv joklakula banggu lo okv rongolo minggo kartoku. Hv ogubv ripv nvdw vla nyi mvnwngngv vnglinla kaatoku, <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>okv vdwlo bunu Jisu gvlo aatokudw, bunu alvmanv dow atwng go gvvkinv nyi um kaapa toku. Nw hoka dooto, vjikotoku okv mvngnam rinam v alvtokula; okv bunu mvnwng v busu nyatoku. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Alvmanv dow vdwgv lvkobv nyi angv um ogubv ripvnvdw okv vrik vdwgv lvkwng bvka kaanv vdwv nyi vdwa mintam nyatoku.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu Jisunyi bunugv mooku lokv vngro tokukv vtoku.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Jisu gv svpwlo aalwkrilo, nyi alvmanv dow vdwa gvvnv nyi angv ninyia kooto, “Ngamka noogv lvkobv vngmulabvka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Vbvritola Jisu ninyia vngmumato. Vbvmabvdv, nw ninyia minto, “Ahtu noogv lvgabv vdwgo ripv kudw okv vdwgo aya pvkudw no noogv naam lo vnglakula nyi vdwa mintam jilakuka.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Vbvrinamv ho nyi v vnglaku Jisu gv ninyia ogugo ripvdw hum Banggu Vring nyi lo minggojitoku, hoka nyi mvnwngngv tvvtokula lamngak nyatoku.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jairas gv kuunyijar okv Jisu gv vji a mvsitnv nyimv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mt 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Jisu vngkorla vngrap toku svparsvlv takdv gonvlo. Ho svparsvlv hoka kairungbv nyitwng go ninyia vngkumla dooyumto. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Jairus, Jius kumkunaam gv nyigam gobv rinv aalwkto, okv vdwlo nw Jisunyi kaapa pvdw, nw atubongv Jisu gv lvpa lvkwnglo gilwk toku <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>Okv dinchi rungbv ninyia kooto, “Ngoogv kuunyijar angv achialvbv lvvmapv. Ayala aagvrila noogv laak v ninyia mampo jilabv, vbvribolo nw poyariku okv turreku!”<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Vbvrinamv Jisu ninyia lvkobv vngrap mingv toku. Twngtv rungnv nyi go Jisunyi lvkobv vngming gvto hoka vngku dvdvlo ninyia nyitwng ngv kaiyaya bv vngyumto.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Hoka mvvga ako nyingring gola nyingnyi achialvbv oyi sarla silvmanv go dooto, <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Daktor achialvgo ninyia vdwnv dw go mvkwrikw toku. Nw atugv morko mvnwngnga mva tvku, vbvritola alvyaku svnga nw alvmabvya riayaya toku. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Nw Jisu gv lvkwng a tvvpato, vkvlvgabv nw ninyigv adar ayi nyitwng gv arwnglo aato, <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Atu v minsuto, “Ngo ninyigv vji a mvsit bolo, ngo poyariku.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Nw Jisu gv vji a mvsit toku, okv ninyigv oyi sarnam v ho vjakgobv nyedatoku; okv nw atu v arwnglo himpa sitoku nw adwkaku lokv poya kunam a. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Vjakgobv Jisu ninyigv lokv mvpunvnv go linyi bv vla himpa sito, hoka nw dakyitkarla kaakarto nyitwng a okv tvuto, “Yvvla ngoogv vji a mvsit nvngv?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv mirwkto, “No kaatoka vkamgo nyi nyitwng ngv nam lvvbum nama; ogubv no tvvka doonv yvvla nam mvsit nvngv vla?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Vbvritola Jisu kai tacha karla kaakarto yvvbvri rinvsi vla. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Mvvga angv dwdw toku ogugo ninyia ripvkudw, vkvlvgabv nw busu v jinjinrumrumla aato, Jisu gv lvpalo guplwkto, okv ogumvnwng nga jvjvkvlv bv ninyia minpa toku. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Jisu ninyia mintoku, “Ngoogv kuunyijar, noogv mvngjwng ngv nam mvpu pvku. Sarsopoyo bv vngnyi kulaka, okv noogv hindwkhingku lokv poya lakuka.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Jisu gv svbv minri hoka, Jairas gv naam lokv nyitampingko mego ho aalwkla okv Jairasnyi minpa toku, “Noogv kuunyijar v siro. Ogujego tamsar nvnyi mindwkminku dunv?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Bunu ogugo minpvdw Jisu tvvriamato,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:36</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tvvria matoku; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tvvbotvlikto.</char></note> vbvritola ninyia minto, “Busu mabvka, mvngjwng mvnglaka.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Vbvrikunamv nw Pitar, Jems okv ninyigv boru Jon nyimwng ninyigv lvkobv vngmuto, yvvnyika vnggv mato. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Bunu Jairas gv naamlo vngchi toku, hoka achialvbv kapku nama siinyimar rinam a okv ogu kaagartapa madubv rinam vdwa Jisu kaatoku. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Nw arwnglo aala bunua minto, “Ogubv svbv kaagartapa madubv rinya dunv? Ogubv nonu kapdunv? Vmi si sima laka—nw yumwng dvlaka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Bunu ninyia nyarji nyato, vkvlvgabv nw bunu mvnwngnga agumlo nvnglintokula, vmi gv anvabua okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu aom a aagvla, vmi gv karku karchung arwngbv aatoku. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Nw vmi nyijar a laak lokv gakbwngto okv ninyia minto, “Talita koum,” So minamsi, “Vmi nyijar, ngo nam mindunv gudung tokuka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Nw vjakgobv gudung toku okv vngcharvngyar raptoku. (Nw nyingring gola nyingnyi kunvgo.) Vbvriri hoka, bunu mvnwngngv lamngaknyato. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Vbvritola Jisu kadwk rungbv bunua minto yvvnyika minpa mabvka, okv nw minto, “Ninyia dvnam ogugo jigvrila dvmuto.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Najaret lo toa toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mt 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Jisu ho mooku a kayupila okv atugv banggu naamlo aakur toku, ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv vngming gvto. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Jius Doonualu lo kumkunaamlo nw tamsar raptoku. Ho nyi v achialvbv dooto; okv vdwlo bunu ninyigv lokv tvvtokudw, bunu mvnwngngv lamtoku. “So mvnwng sum nw ogolokv paapv nvdw?” Bunu tvvkato. “Ninyia si ogunv mvngkimvnglak go jipvkunvdw? Ogu ayimbv nw lamrwpanam vdwa rila kaatam dunvdw? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Nw yikungyira mvnv, Meri gv kuunyilo, okv Jems, Josep, Judas, okv Saimon gv abwng mangvri? Nw gv bormv vdwv soka dooma dunvri?” Okv vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia toa toku.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jisu bunua minto, “Nyijwk a mooku mvnwnglo mvngdvdo, mvngdv makuv nw atugv dooku banggu lo okv amiasa lo okv ninyigv ugunyi mvngchiklo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Nw hoka lamrwpanam go rila kaatam nyumato, hoka nw lvvmanv nyi mego gv ao lo laak lakpvto okv bunua mvpu jimwng toku. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Nw kairungbv lamtoku, ogulvgavbolo nyi vdwv mvngjwng nyamato.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jisu lvbwlaksu vring gola anyia vnglin motoku</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mt 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Vbvrikunamv Jisu hoka nampum dvdvlo vnggokarla nyi vdwa tamsar toku. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Nw lvbwlaksu vring gola anyia lvkobv goklwkto okv bunua anyi-anyibv vnglin motoku. Nw bunua alvmanv dow vdwa yaanvnv jwkrw a jitoku <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lk 10:4-11</ref></char></note> okv bunua minto, “Nonugv mooying vngkulo bangngi mvngchik a bvnglaka ogugoka gvyoka—vtwng guka gvyo, giagonv kochak a gvyo, noogv jvkap lo morko guka gvyoka. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Lvkiam gvlaka, vbvritola kvvbi jekok lvvyago gvyoka.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Nw mindvto, “Ogolo nonua alvbv aamudvdw, ho naam lo nonu dooto laka, ho mooku lokv vnglinma dvdwbv. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Nyim 13:51</ref> </char></note> Nonu banggu lo aabolo hoka nyi vdwv nonua alvbv aamu mabolo vmalo minam a tvvria mabolo, um kayulaka okv lvpa gv amukayuk a pakak jilaka v bunua gamrw rwkjinam gubv rire!”<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu vnglin nyatoku okv nyi vdwa rimur lokv lirung tokukv vla japji toku. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Jem 5:14</ref> </char></note> Bunu uyuvram achialvgo charkak toku, okv lvvmanv nyi achialvgo olib tvli piaktoku okv bunua mvpu toku.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jon baptist gv sikunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mt 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mt 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lk 9:19</ref></char>
    </note> So mvnwng gv lvkwng nga vjak Herod Dvbv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dvbv Herod: Herod Antipas, Galili ham rigvdakgvnv</char></note> tvvpa toku, ogulvgavbolo Jisu gv singnamrinam mv mvnwnglo dupwng toku. Nyi kvgonv minto, “Jon Baptist gvlo turnam v aakurpvku! Vkvlvgabv nw so jwkrw lokv lamrwpanam kaatamdo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Kvgonv vbv minyato, “Nw Elija.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Kvvbigonv minto “Nw nyikrwkaanv go, Kvlokvcho gv nyikrwkaanv vdwlokv akonv jvbv kaanam go.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Vdwlo Herod um tvvpapvdw, nw minto, “Nw Jon Baptist bri! Ngo ninyigv dumpo nga paa-pvkunv, vbvritola nw turkur pvkui!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19">Lk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref> </char></note> Herod nw atu v mingap gvrila Jonnyi naatung moto, okv nw ninyia jaako lvktola okv patwk arwnglo tumto. Herod gv svbvrinam si Herodias gv lvkwnglo, yvvnyi nw nywngbv mvpvdw, ninyigv boru Pilip gv nywngbv rijeka. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Jon Baptist minbwngto Herodnyi, “Si no alvrima noogv boru gv nywng nga atu nywngbv mvsunam si!”<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Vkvlvgabv Herodias Jonnyi maatarbv tanyum gvto okv ninyia mvkidubv mvngto, vbvritola Herod gv lvkwnglo nw milin nyumato. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Herod Jonnyi busuto ogulvgavbolo nw chinto Jon alvnvgo okv darwknv nyi go vla, okv vkvlvgabv ninyia ogu mvmabv alvbv doomuto. Nw dw mvnwnglo ninyi gvlokv tvvla kairungnv adwkaku nvgobv rijeka, ninyi gvlokv tvvnwng dvto.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Anyungnga Herodias alvnv dw go paatoku. Hv vbv rito Herodnyi kuubvngdw alulo, nw sorkari nyigam kainv mvnwngnga, sipai nyigam gamtvlvbwng vdwa okv Galili lo nyi rigvdakgvla kairungnv vdwa nvlum dvpam pamgvrilo. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Herodias gv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Herodias gvkuunyijar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ninyigv kuunyijar Herodias.</char></note> kuunyijar aato okv naasi rijito, okv Herod nyila ninyigv nyen vdwa mvngpu dubv mvtoku. Vkvlvgabv dvbv ninyia minto, “No ogugo mvngdu? No ogugo koodudw nam ngo jirungre.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Hoka nw awgo milvnam go mintakla ninyia minto, “Ngo milvla mindunv no ogugo koopvdw ngo jirungre, minbinla ngoogv karv patung gunyi minjeka!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Vkvlvgabv nyijar v vnglintoku okv ninyigv anv nga tvvkato, “Ngo ogugo koose ngvdw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">“Jon Baptist gv dumpo ngakv,” Anv ngv mirwkto.<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Nyijar angv dvbv gvlo baapubv vngkur toku okv koorap toku, “Ngo nam vjak svka Jon Baptist gv dumpo nga taali gulo jilabvkv vla mvngdunv!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Si dvbvnyi achialvbv mvngru motoku vbvritola nw maakv vlakumato ogulvgavbolo ninyia nw nyen vdwgv dookulo milv kunam lvkwngbv. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Vkvlvgabv nw dakyakaya nvnga Jon Baptist gv dumpo nga baapubv bvnglwk tvka vla orto jigvrila vngmu toku. Dakyakaya nvngv vngla, Patwklo aalwk laku, okv Jon gv dumpo nga palin toku; <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Vbvrikunamv nw taali gulo bvnglwk toku okv um nyijar a jitoku, nyijar angv um atugv anv gvlo bvnglwk jitoku. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Vdwlo Jon gv lvbwlaksu vdwv um tvvpa tokudw, bunu aatoku okv ninyigv svma ngam gvvlaku okv um nyibung riitoku.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu hejar angu nyi vdwa dvnam dvmu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mt 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Apostol vdwv aakum toku okv Jisunyi lvkobv kaarwksuto, okv bunu ogugo ripvkudw okv tamsar pvkudw ninyia minpa toku. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Hoka nyi v achialvgo aanv aadu okv vngnv vngdu mvkunamv Jisu la ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv dvnam dvdubvka dw kaaku mato. Vkvlvgabv nw bunua minto, “Klai mvnwngngv vnglaju ngonu mvngwngbv mooku golo hoka ngonu mvngchikre okv nonuno achakgo doonu ladubv.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu atuv jemataiku mooku lo vngdubv vla svpw gulo vngrap nyatoku.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Bunugv vngnam a okv bunu yvvdw um nyi achialvgo kaapato okv chinyato, vkvlvgabv nyi vdwv bunu banggu mvnwng lokv kvdw bv vngla Jisu gvla ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwgv vnglwk jikulo aachi choyato. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Num 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1Dv 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2Kri 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Eje 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mt 9:36</ref> </char></note> Vdwlo Jisu svpw lokv lintokudw, nw so nyi nyitwng nga kaapa toku, okv nw gv haapok v bunua aya mvngpato, ogulvgavbolo bunu svlar a rigvnv kaamanv aingbv rinyato. Vkvlvgabv nw bunua achialvgo tamsar raptoku. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Vdwlo achialvnv dw gubv ritokudw, ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyi gvlo aala minto, “Si jemataiku mooku go, okv so ngonu achialvgo dootokubv. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Nyi vdwa vngmu tokuka, okv bunua vngmula nvchi gv rongo vdwlo okv nampum vdwlo bunu atu v dvnam rvvla dvsu dubv,”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>“Nonu atu v bunua dvse go jitoka” Jisu mirwksito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Bunu tvuto, “No ngonua vngla okv ain lokdwng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">raai okdwng</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Raaji lokdwng ngv nampum lo alu mnyilap gubv rito (kaato Mt 20:2) </char></note> lvngnyi lokv vtwng rvvla bunua dvmu svgo mvngduri?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu bunua tvuto, “Nonuno vtwng vkamgo doopv? Vngla kaateka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Vdwlo bunu paato kudw, bunu ninyia, “Vtwng tangu gula okv ngui nvvnyi guka paapv,” vla mintam toku.<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Jisu vbvrikunamv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto nyi mvnwngnga nvmwng yajinv aolo apum-apum bv dopindoin motoka. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Vkvlvgabv nyi vdwv apum-apum bv doonyala pamkin lo nyi lvnggobv okv chamngu gubv doonyato. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Vbvrinamv Jisu vtwng tangu hala ngui nvvnyi a naatoku, nyidomooku bv kaadungto, okv Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vtoku. Nw vtwngnga pimwk toku okv nyi vdwa ortokv vla ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa jitoku. Nw ngui nvvnyi haka nyi mvnwngnga ortoku. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Nyi mvnwng v dvgudubv dvtoku. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Vbvrikunamv lvbwlaksu vdwv vtwng okv ngui dvlv nga paapi vring gola anyigo naakum toku. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Dvnv dvdv ngv nyiga ngv hejar angu gobv ritoku.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu isi aolo vngkar toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mt 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Jisu nw nyipam a vngmu rikulo, lvbwlaksu vdwa svparsvlv gv takdv gonv Betsaida lo vngcho moodubv vla svpw gulo baapubv aamu toku. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Nyi vdwa alvbv vnglakukv vla minro kochingbv nw moodw lo kumdubv chaatoku. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Vdwlo arium tvkudw, svpw v svparsvlv gv aralo dooto, vbvritola Jisu dvpwlo akin bv rito. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Nw ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa svpw a pullo ngv tormisidu bv kaapato, ogulvgavbolo doori v bunu gvlo rilwkto; vkvlvgabv aru gv aom gvla akv baji gv pingkolo, nw isi ao bv vngla bunu gvlo aatoku. Nw bunua vngbo yatvto,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:48</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vngbo yatvto</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bunu gvlo aapwngto. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>vbvritola bunu ninyia isi ao lo vngkar dubv kaatoku. Bunu mvngtoku, “Si vram go!” okv svgok toku. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Bunu vdwlo ninyia kaapa tokudw bunu achialvbv busu nyatoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Jisu vjakgobv bunua mintoku, “Mvngrw tvka!” “Si ngo sumabv, busu mabvka!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Vbvrinamv nw bunua lvkobv svpwlo aatoku, okv doori v ringin toku. Lvbwlaksu vdwv achialvbv lamngak nyatoku, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>ogulvgavbolo hejar angu a dvnam dvmunam gv arwng gv jvjv nga bunu chimato; bunugv mongrumara ngv um chindubv kamchi madvto.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gennesaret lo Jisu lvvmanv vdwa mvpu jitoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mt 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Bunu svparsvlv nga rapbo toku okv Gennesaret kvdw hoka aatoku, hoka bunu svpwa takpvtoku. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Vbv bunu svpw a vngyurilo, nyi vdwv Jisunyi vjakgobv kachindato. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu ho mooku mvnwnglo joklakula; okv ogolo nw doopv vla tvvpa pvkudw, bunu lvvmanv nyi vdwa bunugv kargianvnv lo karmutvla ninyi gvlo aagv toku. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Okv Jisu gv vngku dvdvlo nampum vdwlo, banggu vdwlo, vmalo rongo vdwlo, nyi vdwv nw bunugv lvvmanv nyi vdwa piokpamdorpamlo aagvla ninyia kodwkkrwkla kooto mamavjeka lvvmanv vdwa ninyigv vji jelap a mvsit moobvkv vla. Okv yvv bunu um mvsit pvkudw bunu pooya nyatoku.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Abuapa vdwgv tamsarnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mt 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Jerusalem lokv aanv Parisis okv Pvbv tamsarnv mego aadum sila Jisunyi dooyumto. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Bunu ninyigv lvbwlaksu megonyi lasok mabv dvnam ham dvdubv kaapa toku, vbvrinam v ribu mato—ho v, bunu Parisis vdwgv nyi v vbvritoka vnam aingbv bunu lasok mato.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>(Parisis vdwv, Jius kvgonv vdwvkam, abuapa gv tamsarnam lokv rimingvto: bunu alvyaungbv lasok mabo loka dvnam dvmato; <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>vmalo bunu bajar lokv aanv ogu-ogu a harkak chomalo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hogugo bajar lokv anvnga bunu harkak chomalo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hogugo bajar lokv arukochingbv bunu vdwv atuv harkak chomadvdvlo.</char></note> dvmato. Okv bunu bunugv chinam achialvbv kvvbi ribu vkv riming gvtato vbv rito, koobu vdwa, pvchwng vdwa, talu vdwa, okv gadw vdwa alvyaungbv harkaknam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">okv gadw haka.</char></note>)<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Vkvlvgabv Parisis vdwv okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv Jisunyi tvvkato, “Noogv lvbwlaksu vdwv ngonugv abuapa vdwgv tamsarla jilu nama riming gvmabv, vbvritoa lasok mabv dvnam a dvnam si ogubv ridunv?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Aij 29:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Aijaya nonugv lvkwngbv nyikrw kaapv namv vdwgo jvjv rungpvku! Nonuno kaakudubvrinv, vbv ninyigv lvknam aingbv:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Pwknvyarnv mindu, so nyi vdw si, ngam gamchar lokv mwng mvngdvdu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">vbvritola jvjvbv bunugv haapok v ngam adudo.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Bunugv ngam kunamjonam v bunugv lvgabv ogu anyung kaamanvgobv rinyadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">ogulvgavbolo bunu nyi gv mvnam pvbv nga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">ngoogv pvbv aing gubv tamsardo!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>“Nonu Pwknvyarnv gv gamki nam a gakye pvvtola okv nyi gv tamsar kolo vngyadu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Okv Jisu minbwngto, “Nonuno nyebabala Pwknvyarnv gv Pvbv nga tua yatola, bununo atugv tamsar nama bvngya dubv vla ridu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Moses gamkito, ‘Nonugv Anv okv nonugv Abua mvngdv laka,’ okv, ‘yvvbunudw atugv Anv vmalo atugv Abua alvmabv beedunv hum sidubv mvreku.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Mog 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Leb 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Det 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Vbvritola nonu tamsardo ho nyi v ninyigv anv okv abua ridur nvdubv ogugo doopv tvla, vbvritola minam v, ‘So si Korban’ (hv minam v, si Pwknvyarnv gv rise ngv ngokv yama), <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>nw ninyigv anv vmalo abua ridur svngv lokv mvngnga suduku. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>So apiabv nonugv nyi vdwa tamsar sarlwknamv Pwknvyarnv gv gamchar a milamia yadu. Okv ho apiabv kvvbi rinam vka achialvbv nonu ridu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyi a darwk momanv oguogu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mt 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Vbvrinamv Jisu lvkodv nyitwng go goklwk tvla okv bunua minto, “Nonu mvnwngngv, ngoogv minam a tvvria tvka, okv chinlaka. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Agum lokv ogu-ogu v nyi gv arwnglo aanv hv ninyia darwk madubv mvla madunv. Vmabvyadv, so si nyi gv lokv ogu-ogu linv hv nyi a darwk madubv mvya dunv.” Tvvto laka, hvbvrikunmv, nonuno nyarung doodu nvlo. <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Vbvrikunamv, tvvtoka, nonu nyarung gvdubolo.<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Vdwlo nw nyitwng ham kayu pikula okv naamlo vngtoku, nw gv lvbwlaksu vdwv so gv minam sum minbwk jilabv vla ninyia tvuto. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Jisu mintoku bunua, “Nonuno yvv kvvbinyi aka chilvyama,” “Nonu chima? Nyi a agum lokv arwnglo aanv ogu-ogu hv jvjvbv ninyia ogugoka darwk madubv mvlama, <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>ogulvgavbolo si ninyigv haapok lo aamadu vbvritola ninyigv leit arwnglo okv vbvrinamv ayak lokv agum liyadoku.” (Svbv mindula, Jisu minbwk jito dvnam dvdv ngv alvdu dvdubv.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Okv nw minbwngla minto, “So si ogugo nyi arwnglokv agum linv hv yadv ninyia darwk madubv mvdu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Arwng lokv, nyi gv haapok lokv, alvmanv nga mvnglindu hv ninyia gwngmursingmur ridung nga rimudu, chorit modu, mvki modu, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>kvvbi gv nywngnyilu nga kaabiu modu, dvgum mola, okv alvmanv dvdv nga rila; dvkupdvritla, konurvnvla, Tanyumtakitla, mvngyakayala, kaimvngsula, okv riporiola <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>So mvnwng si alvmanv ngv nyi gv arwng lokv lindu okv ninyia darwk momadu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyimvmvvga akogv mvngjwng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mt 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Vbvrinamv Jisu vngyula vnglintoku Taire gv pamtv mooku adarlo. Nw naam gulo aatoku okv ninyia hoka doopv vla yvvnyika chingku nwngmagvri, vbvritola nw doosi nyumatoku. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Nyimvmvvga go, ninyigv kuunyijar a alvmanv dow naanamgo, Jisunyi tvvpato okv vjakgobv ninyi gvlo aato okv ninyigv lvpalo gilwkto. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Nyimvmvvga angv Jentail go, Sairia gv Poenesia mooku lo bvngnam go. Nw Jisunyi koodwkkrwkla kooto ninyigv kuunyijar lo alvmanv dow a charkak jilabv vla minto. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Vbvritola Jisu mirwksito, “Klai ngonu vmi vdwa dvmu cholaju. So si alvbv rima vmi gv dvnam a dvritla okv iki vdwa orjinamv.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>“Tamsarnv,” Nw mirwksito, “iki vkadv vmi gv dvgianvnv Tebul lvkwnglo dootola dva nama dvriadu!”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Vkvlvgabv ninyia Jisu minto, “Ho mirwk sinam lokv, no naambv vngkur nyiku laka, hoka no kaapare uyu gv dow v noogv kuunyijar lokv liro kunam a!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Nw naambv vngtoku okv kaapato ninyigv kuunyijar a gadw lo kardubv; alvmanv dow v jvjvrungbv ninyia kayupila vngrotoku.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu rungji-gangkak nvnga mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu Taire gv namrwk a vngyula okv Sidon gv Galili svparsvlv nga vngpitla, pamtv vring gv lamtvlo vngdungrilo. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Nyi megonv nw gvlo nyi ako aagvjito hv rungji okv milin nyumabv minvgo, okv bunu Jisunyi kodwkkrwkla kooto ninyigv laak v nyi agv aolo lakpv jilabv vla. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu nyi hum nyitwng lokv serwlaila ninyigv lakching ngv nyi agv nyarung nga chilwkto, okv nw atubogv lakchinglo chorbiak gvrila ninyigv riu ha mvsit to. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu nyidomooku tolo kaadung tvla, achialvbv sagwngto, okv nyi anga minto, “Ephphatha,” So minamsi, “Tvvpa tokukv!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Vjakgobv nyi angv tvvpa nyula toku, vkvgv gangkakla minam v nyetoku, okv nw miraptoku ogu mintupminchi kaakumabv. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu nyi vdwa orto jitoku so sung yvvnyika minpa mabvka; Vbvritola nw bunua mimabvkv vla vdwgo orto jikubvdw, bunu kaiyayabv minbv toku. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Okv hum tvvpanv mvnwngngv lamrwpabv tvvto. “Oguaingbv nw alvrungbv ogumvnwng nga ridapvnv gubvri!” Bunu mvngpula gokto. “Nw rungji nvnga tvvpa dubv okv gangkak nvnga japdubv, mvrungdu!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu hejar api nyi vdwa dvnam jila dvmu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mt 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Achakgo ayungjvma nga kainv nyitwng kvvbigo aadumsito. Vdwlo nyi vdwv oguka dvse kaaku mato kudw, Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa ninyigvlo goklwkto okv minto, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Ngo aya mvngpadu so nyi vdwgv lvgabv, ogulvgavbolo bunu nga lvkobv remin gvkunamv alu loum pvku okv vjak oguka dvse kaakuma. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Ngo bunua dvnam dvmumabv bunua naam lo vngmu kubolo, bunu vngkulo bunu anyu kumare, ogulvgavbolo bunu megonv adu lamtv lokv aato.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Nw gv lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia tvvkato, “Vbvritola nyi vdwsum chukrimooku arwng soka yvvla dvnam dvgubv dvmu svgo paanyujinv?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>“Nonugvlo vdwgo vtwng doopv?” Jisu tvvkato.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">“Vtwng takkanw go,” bunu mirwkto.<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Nw nyitwng a kvdw aolo doodubv minto. Vbvrikunamv nw vtwng kanw a naatoku, Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyika hvto, vtwng nga pinpinpiinto, okv nyitwng nga orpinoryin dubv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa jitoku; okv lvbwlaksu vdwv vbv rijito. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Bunu gvlo achokgo ngui miyangnv vkv dootato. Jisu umbonyika hvto ho hung okv lvbwlaksu vdwa bunua ortadubv mintoku. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8-9"/>Mvnwngngv dvtoku okv dvguto—hoka nyi v nyigagaatv dvdv ngv hejar api gobv rito. Vbvrikunamv lvbwlaksu vdwv pintungpiung dvlv nga paapi kanw go yarpok dubv naapv toku. Jisu nyi vdwa vngmutoku <verse eid="MRK 8:8-9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>okv vjakpi gobv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv svpw akolo aatoku okv Dalmanutha mookulo vngtoku.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Parisis vdwv lamrwpanam go kootoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mt 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mt 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Lk 11:16</ref></char>
    </note> Parisis kvgonv Jisu gvlo aato okv ninyia lvkobv larmi surapto. Bunu ninyia naatung dubv, vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia tvvkato lamrwpanam go kaatam labvkv ho kaapadubv Pwknvyarnv ngv ninyia yarlwknama. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mt 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Lk 11:29</ref> </char></note> Vbvritola Jisu haang arwng lokv sakwla okv minto, “Ogulvgabv silugv nyi vdwsi lamrwpanam go rito vla tvvka dunv gubvre? Maa, ngo nonua mindunv! Svkvnv kaachin nvnvgo jimare so nyi vdwa!”<verse eid="MRK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Nw bunua vngyula, svpw arwnglo aakur lakula, okv vngrap toku svparsvlv gv takdv gonvlo raptoku.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herod gvla okv Parisis vdwgv vpap</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mt 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv vtwng dvgudvbv bvnglwk svnga mvngpa kuma toku okv vtwng takin gomwng bunugv lvkobv svpw hoka gvlwkto. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Lk 12:1</ref></char></note>“Hintolaka,” Jisu bunuam gamrwto, “Okv nonuno atu v Himasulaka Parisis vdw gvla okv Herod gv vpap am.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Bunugv arwnglo bunu atubongv japrap minsuto: “Nw sum mindo ogulvgavbolo ngonu gvlo vtwng kvvbigoka kaakuma.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Jisu chinto bunugv ogu gunyi minpvkudw, vkvlvgabv nw bunuam tvvkato, “Ogulvgavbolo nonuno ogu dvnam gvma vla raamisidunv? Nonuno chima vmalo vjakka chimare? Nonuno haang ngv achialvbv pvchapvnv ai? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Jer 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Eje 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mk 4:12</ref> </char></note> Nonuno nyik doodu—nonu kaapamadu nvri? Nonuno nyarung gvdu—nonu tvvpa madonvre? Nonu mvngpa madunvri <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>vdwlo ngo hejar angu nyi vdw lvgabv vtwng tangu a pintak piyak ika? Vdw paapi akomaring nvgo pintungpiung dvlv nga nonuno naakumpv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">“Vring gola anyi,” bunu mirwkto.<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>“Okv vdwlo ngo hejar api nyi vdw lvgabv vtwng takkanwa pintak piyak ika,” Jisu tvvkato, “Vdw paapi akomaring nvgo Pintungpiung dvlv nga nonuno naakumpvnv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">“Kanw go,” bunu mirwkto.<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>“Okv vjaklodvbv nonuno chimadunvri?” Nw bunuam tvvkato.<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyikchingnv nyi go Betsaida lo mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Bunu Betsaida lo aatoku, ho hoka nyi twnggonv nyi nyikchingnv ako Jisu gvlo aagvjito okv ninyia gaksit jibvkv vla kodwkkrwkla kooto. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Jisu nyikchingnv nyi hum laak lokv svla ila okv ninyia nampum agum bv vnggvto. Nw nyi vkvgv nyik a chorbiakro kochingbv, Jisu ninyigv laak v nyigvlo lakpvto okv nw a tvvkato, “No ogugo kaapa lado kure?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Nyi angv moorapla kaato okv minto, “Vvm ngo nyi vdwa kaapa ladoku, vbvritola bunu singnv aingbv vngyit kardu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Lvkodv Jisu ninyigv laak v nyi vkvgv nyiklo mampvto. So dw lo nyi angv kaanwngla kaarapto, ninyigv nyik kaapa nvnv ngv aatoku, okv nw ogumvnwng nga kaabwk toku. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu nyi hum, “Nampum arwng bv vngkur kuyoka” vla minggap gvrila naam bv vngmu toku.<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu yvvdw um Pitar gv milin kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mt 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv Kaisaria Pilippi nampum adarlo vnglintoku. Lamtv vngtunglo nw bunua tvvkato “Nga minpato, nyi vdwv nga yvv vla mindu?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Lk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref> </char>
    </note> Megonv mindu no Jon Baptist kv, bunu mirwkto; “Kvvbi v mindu no Elija kv, kvgonv mintadu no nyijwk vdwlokv akonv noo kv.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref> </char>
    </note> “Nonu ogubvla?” Nw bunua tvvkato.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">“Ngam nonu yvv vla mindunv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pitar mirwksito, “No Kristo rung.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu bunua gamrwto, “Ngoogv lvkwng nga yvvnyika minpa mabvka.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv hinchingchingla sise nga mintoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mt 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa tamsar rapto: “Nyia Kuunyilo ngv hinchingre okv nyigagaatv vdwgv, nyibu butv vdwgv, okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdw bunugv toa kunam gobv rire. Ninyia sidubv mvre, vbvritola alu loum kochinglo nw turkur riku.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Nw hum bunua chinbwkdubv ritoku. Vkvlvgabv Pitar ninyia gaklaila vngsum gvto okv ninyia yamrapto. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Vbvritola Jisu dakkur dakrwkla, kaato ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa, okv Pitarnyi yamtoku. “Uyu no, ngoogv lokv vngroto,” nw minto “Noogv mvngnam v Pwknvyarnv gv lokv aama vbvritola nyi gvlokv!”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14:27</ref> </char>
    </note>Vbvrikunamv Jisu nyitwng nga okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa ninyi gvlo goklwkto. “Yvvdw ngoogvlo aanvpv mvngdunv,” nw bunua minto “Hv atu v mvngnga sutola, ninyigv daapo nga gvtola okv ngam vngming gvlaka. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note> Yvv atubongv gv singdung nga singdubv mvngnv ngv hv ngoore; vbvritola yvvdw atugv singdung nga ngogvbv ngoobolo okv Alvnv Yunying lvgabv mvngbu v singyare. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>No nyiamooku mvnwng sum no gvbv mvtola, no atubogv yalu a nyemu namv, hv no ogu anyung go doopvla? Anyung kaama! <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Nw gv singdung nga lvkodv singdukubv ninyia jinyunv oguguka kaama. <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Yvvnyi hv pwknvyarnv chimanv okv alvmanv alu so ngam la ngoogv tamsar nama hinying dunv, humka nyia kuunyilo ngv vdwlo nyidogindung gv lvkobv ninyigv Abu gv yunglit lo aarikudw ninyia hinying ngurv riku.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Okv nw minbwngla minto, “Ngo nonua mindunv, ho mego si doodu hv vdwloka simare Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga jwkrw nga lvkobv aaku nama bunu kaama dvdvlo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ayak akuavnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mt 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2Pit 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref> </char>
    </note> Alu lokv kochingbv Jisu, Pitar, Jems, okv Jon, bunua aonv moodw golo chaagvto, ho kvvbinyi kaama bunu mwng. Ho Jisu bunugv kaakulo akusubv ritoku, <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Okv ninyigv vjiv Yapung toji toku—nyia mooku so yvvgv vji a nukakjeka hung yapung yanv kaamare. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Vbvrikunamv lvbwlaksu aom v kaapato Elija okv Moses Jisunyi lvkobv raami sidubv. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Pitar milinla Jisunyi minto, “Tamsarnv, ngonugv soka doonam si achialvbv alvnamgo! Ngonu so taabio aomgo mvre akonyi noogv lvgabv, akonyi Moses gvbv okv akonyi Elija gvbv.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Pitar la kvgonv achialv busuto ho nw ogugo minsedw chingkumato.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Vbvrikunamv haapum ako kaklwkla okv bunua doonyum lokv nyumrumto, okv haapum lokv gaam gamgo milinto, “Si ngo atugv paknam Kuunyilo ngv—ninyia tvvyato!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Bunu baapu alvbv kaitkarto vbvritola yvvnyika kaapamato; Jisu mwng bunugv lvkobv dooto.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Bunu moodw lokv iku nvngv, Jisu bunua minto, “Yvvnyika minpa mabvka nonu ogugo kaapvdw, nyia kuunyilo ngv sinam lokv turkurma dvdvlo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Bunu ninyigv minamtvto, vbvritola bunugv arwnglo bunu rarap minsuto ho gaam am, “Sinam lokv turkurkunam’ si ogu a mindu nvgubvre?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mt 11:14</ref></char></note>Okv bunu Jisunyi tvvkato, “Ogubv Pvbv tamsar nvngv mindu ho Elija aacho yinvpv?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Nw gv mirwknamv, “Elija jvjvklvbv aachoreku ogumvnwng nga alvbv ripv reku. Vbvritola Darwknv Kitaplo ogubv mindu ho Nyia Kuunyilo ngv achialvbv hinching reku okv toanam gobv rireku? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Ngo nonua mindunv, ogubvrijeka, Elija aapvku okv ho nyi vdwv Darwknv Kitaplo ninyigv lvkwng nga minam jvbv ninyia bunugv mvngkubv rinyato.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu vmiyapa alvmanv dow gvnvgo mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mt 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Lk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Vdwlo bunu lvbwlaksu kvgonyi vngdum sitokudw, bunu nyitwng go bunua vngyum dubv kaapato Pvbv tamsarnv megonv lvkobv larkwng minsuto bunuam. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Vdwlo nyi vdwv Jisunyi kaatodw, bunu maatar alvbv lamkato, ho ninyia jokrwkto okv naarwk sila luurwkto. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa tvvkato, “Ogugola nonugv bonuam larmisinam hv?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Nyitwng lokv nyi akonv mirwkto, “Tamsarnv, ngo ngoogv kuunyilo nga no gvlo aagv jipvnv, ogulvgavbolo ninyigvlo alvmanv dow v dootola okv milin nyumado. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Vdwlo ninyia dow v aalwk ridw, hv ninyia dookulo taba modu, okv ninyigv gaam lokv sipiktait v lindu, ninyigv hijung ngv hitwkkrwkdu, okv mvnwnglo kamdaramda lwkdu. Ngo noogv lvbwlaksu vdwa darwkmanv dowa charlin jilabvkv vkwto, vbvritola bunu rila nyumato.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Jisu bunuam minto, “Vdwgo mvngjwng manv nyi vla nonu! Vdwgo ngo nonua lvkobv doobamre? Vdwgo ngo nonua lvkobv mindin minbiayare? Vminyilo nga ngo dookuso bvnglwkto!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Ninyia bunu Jisu gvlo bvnglwkto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Vjakgobv dow v Jisunyi kaapa sopikda, ung vminyilo nga dvato, vkvlvgabv nw kvdw lo hopvto okv gaam lokv svpiktait linla, gwchargwyarto. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Jisu abua tvvkato, “Vdwlokv nyi si svbv ripvnv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Abu v mirwkto, “Nw gv vmi anga lokv.” <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>“Achialvgo darwkmanv dow v ninyia mvkidubv gwngkwto vmvlo nw joklwkla okv isi loka. Ngonua aya labvka okv ringlabvka, no riso mvngbolo rilare!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>“Vm,” Jisu minto, “No ogubv mindunv, no rilabolo vla! Ogumvnwng a riladu nyi v yvv mvngjwng pvdw.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Abu v vjakgobv kapkok linto, “Ngo mvngjwngdu, vbvritola mvngchima. Awgo doodubv ngam ridur labvka!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Jisu chintoku nyitwng gv bunua nvchilo jokkum kunam a, vkvlvgabv nw alvmanv dowa gamkito. “Rungji okv gangkaknv dow,” nw minto, “Ngo nam mindunv so vminyilo sokv linro tokuka okv lvkodv nw gvlo aakur kuyoka!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Dow v svgok toku, vminyilo anga alvmabv jinjin mola gipv motokula, okv lintoku. Vminyilo angv sipvkunv aingbv kaato, okv mvnwngngv mintoku, “Nw sipvku!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Vbvritola Jisu vminyilo anga laakbv gagbwng toku okv ninyia godung dubv ridurto, okv nw godung toku.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Jisu arwnglo aaro kochingbv, ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia tvvrwsula tvvkato, “Ogulvgabv ngonu dowa charlin nyuma dunv?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Kumnam mvngchik lokv vkv nvnga charlin nyure; ogu gunvka rinyu mare.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv sise lvkwng nga lvkodv mintoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mt 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Lk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv ho mooku a kayupikula okv Galili nga vngpikla vngtoku. Jisu nw atu hv ogolodw um yvvnyika chimmuso mvngmato, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>vkvlvgabv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa nw tamsarto: “Nyia Kuunyilo nga nyi gv laaklo laklwk reku bunu ninyia mvki riku. Alu loum kochinglo, ogubvrijeka, nw turkur reku.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Vbvritola bunu tvvchin mato so tamsarnam si ogu vdw, okv bunu busu nyato ninyia tvvka svnga.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yvvla kaiyachoknv?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mt 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Bunu Kaparnaum lo aatoku, okv arwnglo aachinam kochingbv Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa tvvkato, “Nonuno lamtv vngtunglo ogubv lardung minsupvnv?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22:24</ref> </char>
    </note> Vbvritola bunu ninyia mirwkmato, ogulvgavbolo bunugv pingkolo yvvbvri kaiyachok jinv ngv vla lamtv vngtunglo lardung minsu kunam lvgabv. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mt 20:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">Mk 10:43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lk 22:26</ref> </char></note> Jisu dootokula, lvbwlaksu vring gola anyia goklwkto, okv bunuam minto, “Yvvdw vngcho nvpv mvngdunv v atubongv mvnwng gv kochinglo vngtoka okv mvnwng gv pakbu bv ritoka.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Vbvrikunamv nw vmi ako gakbwng toku okv ninyia mvnwng gv atuklo dakmu toku. Nw gv laak hv vmi anga chegapto okv bunuam minto, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char></note> “Yvvdw so vmi vdw sokv ako gonyika ngoogv amin bv naarwk bongv, hv ngaaka naarwk sidunv; okv yvvdw ngam naarwk sidunv, hv ngam mvngma vbvritola ngam so jilwkbu angaka naarwk dunv.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yvvdw ngonua rinying madunv hv ngonu gvngv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Lk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Jon Jisunyi minto, “Tamsarnv, ngonu nyi ako noogv amin bv uyuvram vdwa charkak dubv kaato, okv ngonu ninyia rima bvkv vla minto, ogulvgavbolo nw ngonugv apum lokvma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>“Ninyia mintor dubv rikw mabvka,” Jisu bunuam minto, “Ogulvgavbolo yvvdw ngoogv amin bv lamrwpadubv rinv ngv hv koching nga baapubv ngoogv amina minyingminsu mimare. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mt 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Lk 11:23</ref> </char></note> Yvvdw ngonua rinik madunv v ngonu gvbvku. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mt 10:42</ref></char></note>Ngo nonua jvjvbv mindunv yvvdw nonua isi tvngse go jidunv hv ninyigv jijo amina paarungre ogulvgavbolo nonu ngo gvngv.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pokayarka la rimur monv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mt 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>“Yvvdw akonvnga mvngjwng doonv vmi sum gwngka riadunv, v alvyare ho nyi angv vlwng pwktv nvlo atugv lvngpolo yiklwk sutola okv svmasa lo poklwk sunam v.” <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mt 5:30</ref></char></note>Vkvlvgabv nogv laak gonv noogv mvngjwng nga ngoomu dvbolo, ung paato! Si alvyare laak gonv kamabv singkulo aalwknamv okv laak laknyia gvgvrila uyumooku bolo vmv ngapma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo bars 44 sum lvktamdo: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hoka bunuam Tapum v chedu v vdwloka simare, okv vmv ngv bunuam gudu hv vdwloka ngapmare’ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Bars 48 sum kaato).</char></note> kolo vngmam svnga. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Hoka bunuam tapum vdwv chedu v vdwloka simare, okv vmv ngv bunuam gudu v vdwloka ngapmare. <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Okv noogv lvpa gonv noogv mvngjwng nga ngoomu dvbolo, ung paato! Si alvyare lvpa gonv kamabv singkulo aalwknamv okv lvpa lvnyia gvvgvrila uyumooku bolo japlwk kosenga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo bars 46 sum lvktamdo: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hoka bunuam Tapum v chedu v vdwloka simare, okv vmv ngv bunuam gudu hv vdwloka ngapmare’ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Bars 48 sum kaato)</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Hoka bunuam Tapum v chedu v vdwloka simare, okv vmv ngv bunuam gudu v vdwloka ngapmare. <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mt 5:29</ref> </char></note> Okv noogv nyik gonv noogv mvngjwng nga ngoomu dvbolo, hung kolinto! Si alvyare noogv lvgabv nyik nyikin tvla Pwknvyarnv gv karvlo aalwknamv okv nyiknyi ha gvgvrila uyumooku bolo japlwk kosenga. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Aij 66:24</ref> </char></note> Hoka bunuam Tapum v chedu v vdwloka simare, okv vmv ngv bunuam gudu hv vdwloka ngapmare.<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>“Mvnwngnga vmv lokv ramdarre oguaingbv erinpeelwk nama alu lokv piakdar dvdw.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mt 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Lk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref> </char>
    </note>“Alu v alvnvgo; vbvritola ho gv tinam v ngeku bolo, oguaingbv lvkodv ung tidukubv mvnyure?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Alu jvbv nonugv pinkolo ajin jinla, okv sarsopoyo bv ribam dakbam laka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu burmisinam lvkwng nga tamsar toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mt 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu ho mooku a vngyula, Judia mookubv vngtoku, okv jordan svko nga raptoku. Nyitwng v lvkodv ninyia vngyum toku, okv ninyigv ribwngnam aingbv, bunuam nw tamsar toku.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Parisis kvgonv ninyigvlo aato okv ninyia kupdubv gwngto. Bunu tvvkato, “Ngonua minpa labv, ngonugv Pvbv lo nyiga ngv atugv nywng nga apak dubv dopvnvre?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Jisu mirwk siyingla tvvkato, “Moses nonua ogu Pvbv go minpvpi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Bunugv mirwknamv, “Moses gv minpv namv nyiga ngv atugv nywng nga apak dubv vnglin nvnv pota go lvktola vngmulaka hvpv.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Det 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mt 5:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Jisu bunuam minto, “Moses nonugv lvgabv so Pvbv nga lvkto ogulvgavbolo nonua tamsar sarnyu manam lvgabv. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Atk 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref> </char></note>Vbvritola atuake ho, Pwklinyarlin rilo, ‘Pwknvyarnv bunua nyimv okv nyilo bv,’ darwknv Kitaplo vbv mindu. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7,8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Atk 2:24</ref></char></note>‘Okv vkvlvgalo nyiga ngv atugv anv okv abua kayupila okv atugv nywng nga lvkobv ririku,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo domado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">okv nwgv nywng nga lvkobv doodu.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>okv anyiv akin gubv ririku.’ Vkvlvgabv bunyi anyikuma, vbvritola akinhvku. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Vbvrikunamv, Pwknvyarnv gv naadumsiku nama nyia nyi gunv yvvjvka um naapin sirung mabvka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Vdwlo bunu naamlo vngkur tokudw, lvbwlaksu vdwv so gv lvkwng nga Jisunyi tvvkato. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11,12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mt 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref> </char></note> Nw bunuam minto, “Nyi v yvv atugv nywng nga apak tvla okv kvvbi nyimvmvvga nga nywng mvbolo atugv nywng nga rinyingdu. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Vkv aingbv, nyimvmvvga ngv yvv atugv nyilu nga apak tvla okv kvvbinyi go nyilu naakubolo hv jwkjwkvrwk manv.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu vmi vdwa boktalwkji toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mt 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Nyi megonv vmi vdwa Jisu gvlo aagvto ninyigv laak lokv bunuam mampv modubv vla, vbvritola lvbwlaksu vdwv nyi vdwa yamtumto. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Vdwlo Jisu um kaapa kunamv, nw haachito okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Vmi vdwa ngoogvlo aamuto, okv bunua mintor mabv, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv bunu aingnv gvngv. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mt 18:3</ref> </char></note>Ngo nonua jvjvbv mindunv. Yvv vmi aingbv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga naarwk madudw nw hoka vdwloka aanyumare.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Vbvrikunamv nw vmi vdwa nw gvlo laachumtoku, ninyigv laak v bunuam akin-akinbv mampvto, okv bunuam boktalwkji toku.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyitvnv nyi go</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mt 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Jisu ninyigv vngkubv lvkodv vngrap tvvdubv, nyi ako joklwk toku, ninyigv lvgaplo gublwkto, okv ninyia tvvkato, “Alvbv Tamsarbo, ngo turbwng nama paadubv ogugo rise vdw?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Jisu ninyia tvvkato, “No ngam ogubv alvnvgo vla mindunv?” “Yvvka alvnvgo kaama Pwknvyarnv akin mwng. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Mog 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Det 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Mog 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Det 5:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:15">Mog 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Det 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:16">Mog 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Det 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Mog 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Det 5:16</ref> </char></note>No gamkinam vdwa chinsudo: ‘Gwngrw gwmabvka; nywngnyilu ribo minsu mabvka; dvcho mabvka; yvvnyika mvvla mimur mabvka; dvkup mabvka; noogv anv okv noogv abua mvngdv laka.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>“Tamsarnv,” nyi angv minto, “Ngoogv yaapa singsa yilokv rila, ngo gamkinam vdwa tvvla ripvkunv.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Jisu ninyia paknambv kaagap jinjinla minto, “No rise ako doodu. Vngnyika okv noogvlo ogugo doopvdw mvnwngnga pyoktoka okv morko nga heema vdwa ortoka, okv no nyidomooku tvlo nyitvyachok reku; vbvritokula aalakula okv ngam vngming gvlaka.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Vdwlo nyi angv so tvvpa kunamv, ninyigv nyukmu v motvkrv tokula, okv mvngdwkla vngtoku, ogulvgavbolo nw achibv nyitv nvgo.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Jisu hoka ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa kaitkarla kaato okv bunuam minto, “Nyitvnv nyi vdwgv lvgabv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo aatv rinyi achialvbv aanyu manam gubv ridu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv ho gv gaam minam vdwa lamtoku, vbvritola Jisu minbwng jito, “Ngoogv vmi vdwa, Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo aadu bv so si achialvbv aanyu manam gubv ridu! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Nyitvnv nyi gv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo aatv rinyi kemel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kemel: Si chukrilo rinv kainv svnwngsvmin</char></note> gv pwsi ungko lo vngpit tvvnam um svnga, si achialvbv aanyu manam gubv riya dunv.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Hokaku lvbwlaksu vdwv achialvbv lamngak nyatoku okv akonv-akonyi tvvka minsu toku, “Vbvribolo, yvvkula ringnam a paala jinv?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Jisu hoka bunuam kaadichinchinla kaato okv mirwkto, “So si nyi gvbv rikanyuma nvgo, vbvritola Pwknvyarnv gvbvma; Pwknvyarnv lvgabv ogumvnwng ngv rinyu dunv.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Vbvrinamv Pitar milin toku, “Kaato, ngonu ogumvnwng nga topu tokula okv nam lvkobv vngming gvdunv.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>“Vm,” Jisu bunuam minto, “Okv ngo nonua mindunv ho yvv akonv naam vmalo boru vdwa vmalo bormv vdwa vmalo anv nga vmalo abua vmalo kuu vdwa vmalo rongo nga ngoogv okv gamlv gv lvgabv topu kubolo, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>sogv singnam sum kaiyachok yago paariku. Nw paariku lwnggo lvvya naamgo, boru go, bormv go, anv go, kuu go okv rongo go—okv ngam mvngjwngnam lokv mvdwkmvku haka; okv singnam gonv aaku bolo nw turbwngnv singnam a paariku. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mt 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Lk 13:30</ref></char></note> Vbvritola, awgonv vjak yvv kainvgobv singpvdw, hv miang nvgobv singreku, okv awgonv yvv vjak, miang nvgobv singpvdw, hv kainvgobv singreku.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv sise lvkwng nga lvom nvbv mintoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mt 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv Jerusalem lo chaadubv lamtvlo vngdungto. Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa vngchoyala vngto, kvgonv lamnyato; adarlo vngming gvnv nyi vdwv busunyato. Lvkodv Jisu vring gola anyi lvbwlaksu vdwa adargolo lingvto okv hoka ninyia ogugo rijinvnga ung mintoku. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>“Tvvyato,” Nw bunua minto “Ngonu Jerusalem bv vngdungdunv hoka Nyia Kuunyilo nga nyibu butvnv vdwgvlo okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwgvlo laklwk reku. Bunu ninyia simu dukubv miyakaya reku okv vbvritola ninyia Jentail haalung gvlo laklwk reku, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Ho bunu ninyia nyarjikau reku, tachor chorbiakre, svnyakpare, okv ninyia mvkire; vbvritola nw alu loum nvnga turkur reku.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jems la Jon bunyi gv dinchibv koonam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mt 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Vbvrikunamv Jebedi gv kuunyilo, Jems la Jon, Jisu gvlo aato. Bunu minto, “Tamsarnv, ngonugv mvngnam akonv ngonugv lvgabv rijilabv vla mvngdunv.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Jisu bunua tvvkato, “Hv ogugola?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Bunu mirwkto, “Vdwlo no noogv yunglit rungnv Karv lo doori kudw, ngonu mvngdu no ngonua noogv lakchilo akonyi okv lakbiklo akonyi, noogv dookulo lvkobv doogv labv vla mvngdunv.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:50">Lk 12:50</ref> </char>
    </note> Jisu bunua minto, “Nonuno chima nonu ogu gonyi koodudw, Ngoogv hinching koobu lo tvngjinam sum um nonu tvnglare? Ngoogv Baptisma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baptisma vnam si Jisu gv hinching chinla sise nga mindunv</char></note> naajinam um nonuno naalare?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Bunu mirwkto, “Ngonu rilare.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jisu bunua minto, “Rinam gvbv nonu ngoogv tvngjikunam hinching koobulo tvnglare okv ngoogv baptisma naajinam apiabv naamwng gvlare. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Vbvritola ngoogv lakchilo okv lakbiklo yvv dooridw um dardubv ngoogvlo kaama. So dooku sam Pwknvyarnv yvvgv lvgabv mvpvjila vvpvnv nw jire.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Vdwlo lvbwlaksu vring ngv um tvvpa tokudw, bunu Jems nyila okv Jonnyi haachi toku. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42,43</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Lk 22:25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char></note>Vkvlvgabv Jisu bunu mvnwngnga lvkobv ninyigvlo goklwkto okv minto, “Nonu chindu yvvnyiv Jiusmanv nyi vdwgv dvbv bv ridunv bunu vdwv bunuam rigvdu, okv rigvnv vdwv achialvbv tojupkunamv doodu. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43,44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mt 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lk 22:26</ref> </char></note> Si, ogubvrijeka, nonugv pingkolo rima svngv. Nonuno gvlo akonv kai yanvpv mvngdulo, nw mvnwng gv pakbubv rirunglaka; <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Okv nonuno gvlo akonv vngcho nvpv mvngdudw, nw mvnwng gv nyirabv rirunglaka. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Nyia kuunyilo jesing ngv rijikodubv aama; Nw rijitebv aato okv ninyigv singtung nga mvngnga yala achialv nyi go ringlin dukubv.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyikchingnv Bartimasnyi mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mt 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Bunu Jeriko lo aalwkto, okv Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwala okv nyitwng nga lvkobv vnggvla vngrilo, Timias gv kuunyilo Bartimas vnam nyikching tola giago nvgu lamtv adar lo dooto. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Vdwlo nw Najaret lokv Jisu kunyi vla tvvpapvdw, nw gokrapto, “Dabid gv kuunyilo, Jisu, ngam aya mvngpa labv!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Achialvnv nyi v ninyia yamto, okv ninyia bunu choibvkv vla minto. Vbvritola nw gamtvyayabv gokto, “Dabid gv kuunyilo, nga aya labvka!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Jisu daktungto okv minto, “Ninyia goklwkto.” Vkvlvgabv bunu nyikchingnv nyi um goklwk jitoku. “Mvngpu laka!” Bunu minto. “Gudunglak nam Jisu gokdu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Vkvlvgabv nw atubogv vji laklwk ka ora toku, pogin pokrapto, okv Jisu gvlo aatoku.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>“No ngam ogugo rijikoso mvngdu?” Jisu nyi um tvuto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">“Tamsarnv,” Nyikchingnv nyi v mirwksito, “Ngo lvkodv kaapa nwngdo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>“Vngnyika,” Jisu ninyia minto, “Noogv mvngjwng ngv nam alvdvbv mvpvku.” Vjakgobv nw kaapatoku okv lamtv ho Jisunyi vngming gvtoku.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu Jerusalem lo Dvbv bv aatoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mt 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Bunu Jerusalem vngchi dase rilo, Betpej gv okv Betani gv banggu nvchilo, bunu Olib Moodwlo aatoku. Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu anyigo kanamla vngcho moto <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>Svkvnv gaam milwkto: “Nonugv vnglwkjiku nampum alo vngnyilaka. Nonu alo vngchi sopikda, siak ako takpvla lvkoka riokw manamgo nonu kaapare. Um paksoklaila okv um soka aagv teka. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Okv nyi gonv nonua ogubv vbv ridunv vla tvvka bolo, so gv Ahtuv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ahtu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">soogv atu. </char></note> sum naanwngdu okv sum baapubv jikur reku vla ninyia minpa laka.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu vngto okv lamtv vngtunglo siak ako naam ako gv agi lo rvngpv dubv kaapa toku. Bunu um taasok rilo, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>nyi mego hoka daknv vdwv bunua tvvkato, “Nonu ogubv rila, siak a taasok dunv?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Bunu Jisu gv milwknam jvbv mirwkto, okv nyi vdwv bunua boomu toku. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Bunu siak a Jisu gvlo boolwk jito bunugv vji laklwk a siak aolo pujito, okv Jisu aolo gecha toku. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Nyi mvnwngngv bunugv vji laklwk a lamtvlo pupvjito, kvgonv rongo lokv svngming pala okv um bunu lamtvlo pipv jito. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Miri 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note> Koching okv habobv vngming gvnv nyi vdwv gokrap nyato, “Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvto! Pwknvyarnv boktalwkji laka Atugv amin bv aanvnga! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Pwknvyarnv boktalwkji laka aainv ngonugv Dvbv Dabid gv Karv nga! Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvdu!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Jisu Jerusalem lo aalwk toku, kumkunaam arwnglo aatoku, okv ogumvnwng nga kaitkarto. Vbvritola alu v loodwng kunam lvgabv, nw lvbwlaksu vring gola anyi lvkobv vnglingvla Betani bv vngtoku.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu koksitkokrik singnv go beekito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mt 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Logo nvnga, bunu Betani lokv vngkurla vngrilo, Jisu kano toku. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Nw adu bv koksitkokrik singnv go anv ngv harbum dubv kaapato, vkvlvgabv nw koksitkokrik apw doopv bvri vla aala kaato. Vbvritola vdwlo nw aatokudw, nw anv mvngchik a kaapa toku, ogulvgavbolo hoka koksitkokrik apw svvdw madvto. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Jisu hoka koksitkokrik singnv nga mintoku, “Yvvka lvkodv noogvlo koksitkokrik dvlwk kumare!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv um tvvpato.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngtoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mt 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Vdwlo bunu Jerusalem lo vngchi tokudw, Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngtoku okv pyoknv okv rvvnv mvnwngnga mvyakmvchak rirap toku. Nw morko lwkkolwkpik nvgv tvbul okv taakw pyoknv dooging okv pyokgingnvnv nga duyakduchak toku, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Okv nw yvvnyika Pwknvyarnvnaam agum bv ogugoka gvvpik momato. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Aij 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref> </char></note>Vbvrikunamv nw nyi vdwa tamsarto: “So si Darwknv Kitaplo lvkpvdu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Aij 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref> </char></note> ho Pwknvyarnv minto, mooku mvnwng gv nyi mvnwng lvgabv ‘Ngoogv Pwknvyarnvnaam hv diringmooku nyi mvnwng gv kumgingjoging naam vla mindunv.’ Vbvritola um dvchochonv vdwgvbv tosi siging kobv nonuno kokda pvjiduku!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>So sum nyibu butvnv vdwv okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv tvvpato, vkvlvgabv bunu Jisunyi ogolo mvki sogobvri vla agi kaarap toku. Bunu ninyia busu toku, ogulvgavbolo ninyigv tamsar nama nyitwng mvnwngngv lamngak nyatoku.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Vdwlo arium tukudw, Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv pamtv nga vngyu toku.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koksitkokrik singnv lokv kaachin sinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mt 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Logonvgv arukamchi lo, bunu lamtvlo vngying dula, bunu koksitkokrik singnv go kaato. Hv singmwng lokv miami mvnwng lobv sintoku. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Pitar mvngpa toku ogugo ripvdw okv Jisunyi minto, “Kaato, Tamsarnv, noogv beenam koksitkokrik singnv ngv sinpvku!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Jisu bunua mirwk toku, “Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngjwngtvka. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mt 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Kor 13:2</ref> </char></note> Ngo nonua jvjvklv bv mindunv ho yvvdw so moodw sum gudungla okv atu v svmasa bolo orlwksuto vla okv ninyigv haapoklo mvngngvm manam kamabv, vbvritola ogugo ninyigv minam v rirungre vla, mvngjwng bolo v nw gvbv rijire. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Svkv lvgabv ngo nonua mindunv: vdwlo nonu kumredw okv ogugonyi kooridw, mvngjwngtvka ung nonu paapvku, okv ogugonyi nonu koobolo nonua jirung reku. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25,26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mt 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:15">15</ref></char></note> Okv vdwlo nonu dakla okv kumbolo, mvngnga laka yvvdw nam rinying pvdw, vkvlvgabv ho nyidomooku aogv doonv Abu noogv rimur a mvngnga jireku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonvkitap lo bars 26 sum lvktamdo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vbvritola no kvvbi ham mvngnga mabolo, aotolo doonv noogv Abu ka, noogv rimur rinam a mvngnga jimare. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Kaato Mt 6:15). </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>No kvvbi haka mvngnga mabolo, noogv Abu nyidomooku aogv doonv tvka noogv rimur rinam vdwa mvngnga mare.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv tujupkunam gv lvkwng nga tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mt 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Bunu lvkodv Jerusalem lo aachitoku. Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngkarto, nyibu butvnv vdwv, Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv, okv nyiga vdwv ninyigvlo aato <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>okv nw ha tvvkato, “No so vdwsum ridubv ogu rilanvnv go doopv? Yvv nam so rilanvnv nga jipvnv?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Ngo nonua vjak gamgo tvkare, okv nonuno nga mirwksito, ngo nonua minpare ogu rilanvnv go ngo doopvdw so vdwa ridubv. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Ngam minpalabv, ogolokv Jon gv Baptisma jilanvnv ngv aapvnv: v Pwknvyarnv gvlore vmalo nyi gvlore?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Bunugv pinkolo bunu larrap minsuto: “Ngonu ogugo mindubv? Ngonu Pwknvyarnv gvlokv vla mirwk sibolo, nw minre, ‘Ogulvgabv, vbvrinamv, nonu Jonnyi mvngjwng mapvnv?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Vbvritola ngonu ‘Nyi lokv vla minbolo...’” (Bunu nyi vdwa busunyato, ogulvgavbolo nyi mvnwngngv Jonnyi nyijwk akobv mvngjwng nyato.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisunyi bunugv mirwknamv, “Ngonu chimado.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Vbvrikunamv Jisu bunua minto, “Ngooka nonua minjimare, ogu rilanvnv lokv ngo so vdw sum ridunvdw.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Anggor rongo rwktin vdwa minchisinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mt 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Aij 5:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 5:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> Vbvrikunamv Jisu bunuam minchisinam lokv mintoku: “Kvvlo nyi ako dooto hv anggor rongo ako mvtoku, hum svlung rakyum toku, anggor nyumjit kobv ungrung ako dutoku okv kaaya koku taabio akochin bioto. Vbvrigvrila nw rwktinnam nyi lo tinlwk toku okv naam a mooying vngyu toku. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Vdwlo anggor a naakumdw hv aato kudw, nw pakbua rwktin gvlo vngmu toku ninyigv paase nga bunu gvlo naarwk simudubv vla. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Rwktin tinam vdwv pakbu nga naatungto, ninyia jvngto, okv arochoko bv vngkur motoku. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Vbvrikunamv atu v pakbu gonvnyi vngmuto; rwktin tinam vdwv ninyia dumpo lokv jvngrap toku okv ninyia achialvbv nyarjikaola mvtungmvre toku. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Atu hv pakbu ako godv vngmuto, okv ninyia bunu mvki toku; okv bunu achialvbv kvvgo nyika vbvdvdvbv mvto, kvgonyi jvngto kvgonyi mvkito. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Akin mvngchik go doomwng toku vngjikunv hv rongo atugv paknam kuunyilo ngv. Vbvrikunamv, atar anyabv, nw ninyigv kuunyilo nga rwktin vdwgvlo vngmu toku. Nw minto ‘Ngo jvjvbv mvngdunv bunu ngoogv kuunyilo nga mvngdvri.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Vbvritola rwktin vdwv bunugv arwnglo raamisito, ‘So si rongo atu gv kuunyilo ngv. Klai, aakumto ninyia mvki laju, okv ninyigv yikungyira ngv ngonu gvbv rireku!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu kuunyilo anga naatungto okv ninyia mvki toku okv ninyigv svma nga rongo agumlo joa toku.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>“Vbvrikubolo, rongo atu v ogu rirekudw?” Jisu Tvvkato. “Nw aareku okv ho nyi vdwa mvkire okv rongo nga kvvbi rwktin lo tinriku. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Darwknv Kitaplo nonu sum puri rirung pvnvri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Naam mvnv vdwgv anyung kaama vla daranam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">vlwng ngv mvnwng a alvyachok nvgobv rito.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Miri 118:22-23</ref> </char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Si Ahtu lokv ritoku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">Si ogu kaasartabobv kaanam go!’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Jius rigvnv vdwv Jisunyi naatung tvvtoku, ogulvgavbolo ninyigv minchisinam minam v bunuam minikla mindu vla bunu ho tvchinto, vbvritola bunu nyitwng nga busunyato, vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia kayula okv vngyutoku.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lampu dorse lvkwng nga tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mt 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Parisis nyi megola okv Herod gv nyi megola Jisu gvlo vngmuto ninyia tvu svgo tvka gvrila naatung dubv vla. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Bunu nw gvlo aala minto, “Tamsarnv, ngonu chindu no jvjv a mindunv, nyi vdwv ogugo mvngdu ho lvkwngbv mvngdwk mabv. No nyi vdwgv mvngnam lokv vngma, vbvritola nyi lvgabv Pwknvyarnv gv ogugo mvngnam jvjv nga tamsaryado. Ngonua minpalabv, Roman Dvbvyachok ka lampu dornam si ngonugv Pvbv nga rinying dunvri? Ngonu dordu bri vmalo dorma dubvri?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Vbvritola Jisu bunugv gwngsi nama kaapatvla mirwksito, “Nonu ogubv nga naatung dubv gwngdunv? Ain lokdwng lo chargo bvnglwkjilabv, okv um nga kaamulabv.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Bunu charkin go ninyigvlo bvnglwk jito, okv Jisu tvvkato, “Si yvvgv nyukmu vla okv aminv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Bunu mirwkto “Dvbvyachok gv.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu minto, “Alvdo, vbvrinamv, Dvbvyachok gvnga Dvbvyachoknyi jitoka, okv Pwknvyarnv gvnga Pwknvyarnvnyi jilaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Hoka bunu Jisunyi lamngak panyatoku.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sinam lokv turkurkunam lvkwng nga tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mt 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Nyim 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Vbvrikunamv nyi sinv, turkur madunv vnv Sadusis mego, Jisu gvlo aato okv minto. <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Det 25:5</ref></char></note> “Tamsarnv, ngonugv lvgabv Moses so Pvbv nga lvkpv jito: ‘Nyi gunv atugv nywng nga kuu bvngma dwbv siyu bolo ho nyi gv boruv hvngmi nga nywng mvla doogv gvrila siyunv nyi ho gvbv kuu bvngji motoka’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Lvko nvnga achiboru kanw go dooto; Achi yachokkv nywng naatoku okv kuu dooma dwbv siyuto. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Vbvrikunamv boru yangv nywng nga doogv toku, okv nw ka kuu bvngma dwbv siyutoku. Boru aom nvnv vka vbvdvdvbv ritoku, <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>okv vbvrikunamv boru dvdv ngv: boru kanw mvnwngngv nyimvmvvga anga nywng mvto okv kuu bvngma dwbv siyu nyatoku. Atar anyabv nyimvmvvga angv sitoku. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Vjak, bunu kanw mvnwngngv ninyia nywng mvto, turkurdw alu lo vdwlo sinv mvnwngngv turkur rikunyi, nyimvmvvga angv yvvgv nywngbv rirekudw?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Jisu bunua mirwk toku, “Vdwgo nonu mvngmur nyadunv! Okv nonu chindure ogulvgabv? So si ogulvgavbolo nonu Darwknv Kitap a vmalo Pwknvyarnv gv jwkrw nga chima namv. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Vdwlo sinv vdwv turkur rikudw, bunu nyidogindung jvbv ririku okv nywngnyilu naami sikumare. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Vjak, sinv ngv turkur nama: nonu lvkoka Moses gv Kitaplo singnv amwng nga vmv gunam lvkwng nga puri rika mapv nvri? Hoka svbv lvkdu Pwknvyarnv Mosesnyi minto, ‘Ngo kuna Abraham gv, Isaak gv okv Jakob gv Pwknvyarnv ngv,’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Pwknvyarnv turnv vdwgv Pwknvyarnv ngv, sinv gvngvma. Nonu achialvbv mvngmordu!” Pwknvyarnv turnv nyi vdwgv Pwknvyarnv ngv, bunu siro kujvka, turdunv. Nonu achialvbv mvngmordu!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaiyachoknv Gamki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mt 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Vbv raami sirilo Pvbv tamsarnv ako hoka tvvla dakto. Nw kaatoku Jisu sadusis vdwa alvrungbv mirwk gvnyibv vla, vkvlvgabv nw Jisu gvlo tvusvgo mvngla aatoku: “Gamkinam mvnwng lokv kaiyachoknv gamlo yachokkv ogolo angv?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:4">Det 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 6:5">5</ref></char>
    </note> Jisu mirwkto, “Gamlo yachoknv sinv ‘Tvvgap tvka, Israel! Ahtu ngonugv Pwknvyarnv mvngchik Ahtuv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ahtu ngonugv Pwknvyarnv mwngchik Ahuv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ahtu ngonugv Pwknvyarnv, Ahtu mwngchikv.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Ahtunyi paklaka noogv Pwknvyarnvnyi noogv haapok mvnwnglo, noogv dow mvnwnglo, noogv mongrumara mvnwnglo, okv noogv gwlwk mvnwnglo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leb 19:18</ref></char></note> Gamnyi nvnv gamlo yachokkv si, ‘No kvvbinyi haka paktoka oguaingbv no atu nvnga paksudvdw.’ So gv gamlo gamnyi so lvvyabv ho kaiyanv gamkinam yagu kaama.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:35">Det 4:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pvbv tamsarnv Jisunyi minto, “Tamsarnv, Alvbv ripv, so si jvjv ngvrung no mingvnyibv, ho Ahtu mwng Pwknvyarnv ngv okv ho hokaka kvvbi Pwknvyarnv yago kaama vbvritola nw mwng. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char></note> Okv nyi v Pwknvyarnvnyi haapok mvnwnglo pakrung laka, okv mongrumara mvnwng loka okv ninyigv gwlwk mvnwng loka; okv kvvbinyi haka no atu v oguaingbv paksudvdw vbv pakmin sirung laka. Svnwngsvmin okv kvvbi go Pwknvyarnvnyi erin rinji mamsenga so gv gamkinam gaam anyi sum achialv bvya tvvgap mvnggapla rise gorung.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lk 10:25-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jisu kaapa toku vdwgo alvrungdo ninyigv mirwknamv, okv vkvlvgabv Jisu ninyia minpa toku, “No Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lokv adu ma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">So kochingbv yvvka Jisunyi tvu svnga choopu nyuma toku.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristo lvkwngbv tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mt 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Pwknvyarnvnaam lo Jisu tamsar sardungla ririlo, nw tvunam go tvvkato, “Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv Kristonyi Dabid gv husi gubv rire vla oguaingbv mindu nvdw? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Miri 110:1</ref></char></note> Dabidnyi Darwknv Dow lokv mimuto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Ahtu ngoogv Ahtunyi minto:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Ngo noogv nyimak vdwa noogv lvpa lvkwnglo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">domuma dvdvlo ngoogv lakbiklo dootoka.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Dabid atubongv ninyia ‘Ahtu’ vla gokto; vkvlvgabv Kristo oguaingbv Dabid gv husi bv ridubv?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Jisu Pvbv Tamsarnv vdwa Gamrw toku</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mt 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Lk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Nyitwng kairungnv go Jisu gv minam a tvvpubv tvvria nyato. <verse eid="MRK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Nw gv bunuam tamsar rilo, nw minto, “Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv jvtvlaklwk asudubv gvtola vngnwng nyanv okv piokpamdorpamlo mvngdv konwng nyanv vdwa himasuto laka, <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Yvv jius kumkunaam vdwlo alvnv dooging nga okv dvpam dvkulo alvyachoknv dooku haka gaknv. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Bunu hvngmi vdwa rinvnvmindu okv bunugv naam a dvritpapidu, okv vbvrikunamv kaatamdu kumnam a asudvbv kumdu. Bunugv hiru rusengv sinama lvyabv rire!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hvngmi gv daan jinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Lk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo morko lwkku jampa nvchilo dooto, nyi vdwgv morko paalwk nama nw kaayato. Nyitvnv nyi vdwv achialv kaibv morko nga paalwk nyato; <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>vbvrikunamv nyima harianv hvngmi go aalwk toku okv lokdwng charchingnv charnyi go hikki arv go paalwk ngurvto. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa goklwkla bunuam minto, “Ngo nonua minpa dunv so nyima harianv hvngmi angv mvnwngnga kaiyabv Daan jampa so paalwk gvnyibv. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Kvvbbi vdwv bunugv nyitvla lvvlin kunam a paalwk nyato; vbvritola hvngmi v, nyimaharia bv rirung dvlachin, nw vdwgo doopvdw hum lwknya chekato—nw ninyigv turgv nvvse ngaaka lwktar jito.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnvnaam gv yakgse nga Jisu mintoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mt 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lokv vnglin rikulo, ninyigv lvbwlaksu akonv ninyia minto, “Tamsarnv, kaatoka! Si achialv kaapu rungnv vlwng okv naam go!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Nonu kaadure kainv naam vdwsum? Vlwng pwkin goka dookulo doobwng kumare; mvnwng sum ngorlula ngora reku.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adwkaku okv mvdwkmvku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:3-14">Mt 23:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Jisu ninyigv Pwknvyarnvnaam kaatok gonvgv Olib Moodw lo doorilo Pitar, Jems, Jon okv Andriu bunu ninyi gvlo aasila aatoku. <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>Bunu minto, “Vdwnyi si ritv rinvdw ngonuam minpalabv, okv so gv mvnwng sokv ridw v aaduku vla ogu go kaaring sinv namgo richo tvdunvdw hum sin ngonua minjilabv.”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Yvvka nonua mvvkup madubv himasito laka. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Achialvgo nyi v ngoogv amina gakka minsure, aagvrila minre, ‘Ngo kunv Jisu!’ okv bunu awgo nyi vdwa mvvkupre. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Okv vdwlo nonu nyimak gv sidupvbin a nvchibv tvvla okv nyimak gv yunying nga adu lo tvvpala adwkaku mabvka. Vkv nvnga rirungjinv, vbvritola v rinya alu v aapvku vnam kaama. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Diringmooku mvnwngngv padar minsi reku; Karv vdwv mvmisureku. Mooku mvnwnglo moobi hwkriku, okv ho dvmayarwng aariku. So vdw si kuu bvngtv rinyi huchi chichonam jvbv rire.”<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9-11</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mt 10:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Lk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char>
    </note> “Nonuno atubongv himasito laka. Nonuam naatung reku okv kvbanaam lo boolwk reku. Nonuam Jius kumkunaam vdwlo mvrit riku; Ngoogv lvkwng lokv bunua Gamlv a minpa dubv nonuam rigvnv vdw okv kvvbi vdwgv kaagialo dakmure. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Vbvritola rinya alu v aama dwbv, Gamlv nga chinggodogo haalung mvnwnglo japcho jirungre. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Okv vdwlo nonuam naatung rekudw okv kvbanaam lo vnggv rekudw, nonu ogugo minsedw vla mvngchola mvngdwk mabvka; vdwlo mindw v aarikudw, minlaka vbvribolo ogugo nonua minpv jipvdw. Nonugv gaam minam vdwv nonu gvngvma; v vdwv Darwknv Dow lokv aareku. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Nyiga vdwv bunu atugv achiboru a mvki modubv laklwk reku, okv abu vdwvka bunugv kuu a vbvdvdvbv rire. Kuu vdwvka bunugv anvabu vdwaka rirwk sire okv bunuam mvkisure. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mt 10:22</ref></char></note> Nyi mvnwngngv nonua ngoogv lvgalokv kaanwng mare. Vbvritola yvvdw rinya alu lobv gakbwngla rilin redw v ringnam a paareku.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Achialvbv busu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-18">Mt 24:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref> </char>
    </note> “Nonuno ‘Achialv busu namgo hv mvyakmvchak jinv go.’ Hoka ninyigv dakma svngvlo dakdubv kaapare.” (Purinv vdwa mindu: Si ogu gonyi mindunvdw chirung laka!) “Vbvrikubolo yvv bunu Judia lo doodunv moodw bv kicha laka. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref> </char></note> Yvvnyi angv nw gv naam namwng mwnglo aolo ridunv naam arwngbv yikungyira naadubv irung mabvka. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Yvvnyi angv rongolo ridunv ninyigv vji laklwk lvgabv naamlo vngkur kuyoka. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Hv alu v nyimvmvvga vdwv kuu gvdunv okv anv vdwv yvv anga ajingnv doodunv ho vdwgvbv achialvbv alvmanv gobv rire! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Svkv nvngv kamching poolu lo rima dubv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumtoka! <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref> </char></note> Ho alu gv hirukaya ngv Pwknvyarnv gv nyiamooku a pwklinyarlin rilokv vjak lobv nyia nyi vdwgv hingkw kunam um svnga si achialvbv alvmanv gubv riyare. Vbvdvdvbv kokwloka vkvnvgo lvko ridv kumare. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Vbvritola Ahtu ho alua loodwng modu; nw vbv rimabolo, yvvka turla renyu mare. Nw gv darkunam nyi vdwgv lvgabv, nw ho alu vdwa loodwng mopvnv.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>“Vbvrikunamv, ‘Kaatoka, Kristo si doodukv!’ Vmalo, ‘Kaatoka, nw alo hv!’ Vla nyi gonv nonua minbolo—ninyia tvjing mabvka. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Mvvnvrunv Kristo ngv okv mvvnvrunv nyikrwkaanv aare. Rilabolo bunu Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwa mvvkup dubv lamrwpadubv okv kaapunv rila kaatamre. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Nonuno atugv lvgabv hima silaka! Ridw hv aamadwbv ngo nonua ogumvnwng nga mincho jipvkunv.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyia Kuunyilo gv aakunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mt 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Aij 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Jol 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:5">3:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Nyikrw 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Aij 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eje 32:7</ref> </char>
    </note>“Hirukaya alu vdwv vngro kochingbv, Doonyi hv kanv riku okv Poolu vka loung kumare, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Aij 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Nyikrw 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Jol 2:10</ref> </char></note>takar vdwv nyidomooku lokv holu re, okv nyidomooku tolo jargvnv gwlwk hv bunugv lokv ngeyu reku. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Nyikrw 1:7</ref></char></note> Vbvrikubolo nyia kuunyilo ngv daklwk riku, jwkrw kairungnv okv yunglit nvgobv rila doomwk lo aareku. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Nw ninyigv nyidogindung vdwa nyia mookugv chenyung api lo vnglin more okv nyido dootar gonv lokv dootar gonv lobv Pwknvyarnv gv darnam nyi vdwa makum more.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koksitkokrik singnv lokv kaachin sinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mt 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>“Koksitkokrik singnv lokv nonu kachin sutoka. Vdwlo so gv hakbv ngv jijibv okv kaapubv riri kudw okv anv harlin rapku bolo dwrw hv nvchi duku vla nonu chindu. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Ho apiabv, vdwlo nonu svkv nvnga ridubv kaapa rikudw, rirap dukubv, dwv nvchi duku vla nonu chinreku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dw hv nvchi duku, rirap tvduku; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nw nvchi duku, aatvduku </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Nonu mvnggap laka so ogu mvnwng vdw si rire vjakgv nyi singnv mvnwng vdwsi sima dwbv. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Siching nyido hv ngelare, vbvritola ngoogv gaam minam hv vdwloka ngemare.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yvvka ho alu vmalo dwa chinv kaama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mt 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Lk 12:36-38</ref> </char>
    </note> “Ho alu, vmalo dwv, vdwlo aarikudw hum chinv kaama-aomooku gv nyidogindung vdwvka, kuunyilo vka um chima; Abu mvngchik chindu. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Kaaya laka, hula doolaka, vdwlo dwv aarikunvdw nonu chima. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>So si nyi gunv atugv naam ha nyira vdwgvlo akin-akin gv rise nga parlwkla okv agi kaaya nvngaka kaaya dubv parlwk pela adu lo mooying vngyu nyonam aingbv rire. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Himasuto laka vbvrikunamv, ogulvgavbolo nonuno chimado vdwlo naam gv atu hv aarikudw—si arium nyika vmalo yupra nyika vmalo arumadv bv vmalo doonyie poklin madvbv. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Nw dvminmabv aaku bolo, nonua yupla doodubv ninyia kaamu rungyoka. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Ogugo ngo nonua mindudw, vbvrikunamv, ngo mindunv mvnwng ha: Hima silaka!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Nyirunv vdwv Jisunyi rinying toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mt 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Mog 12:1-27</ref> </char>
    </note>Vngbodvnam okv Vpap lwkmabv vtwng dvnam pumja alu vdwgv aase ngv loonyi go doodubv, nyibu butv vdwv la Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv Jisunyi nyi chimpa madubv naatungla mvkidubv vla kaakarnyato. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Bunu minto, “Nyi vdwv yalungyachung bv rijila, ngonu pumja alulo sum riyojuka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Betani lo tvli piaktoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mt 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37">Lk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char>
    </note>Jisu Betani lo Saimon gv naam lo dooto, nw apin yaritla lvvma kunvgo. Jisu gv dvnam dvla doorilo, nyimvmvvga ako daaching pumchup<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daaching pumchup vnam si Alabastar vla Baibel lo lvkpvdo</char></note> gulo achialv arvdoonv nampunv piaknam ala darwk dubv mvlinnam vkv akudubv bvngla hila aato. Nw pumchup a mvkok gvrila nampunv ala um Jisu gv dumpo lo piakto. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Hoka nyi kvgunv haachirapto okv akonv akonyi raamisito. “Ogu rinvla nampu nvnga pwgga mindunv? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Sum lwngngom lvnv raaji lokdwng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Silbar lokdwng kaatoka 6:37. Ain lokdwng lwngngom si nyi akin gv anying nywng go nyilap lapkwng nama kaaring sidu.</char></note> gubv piokgv rila okv um morko nga heemanv vdwa jiya bolo alvnamv!” Okv bunu nyimvmvvga nga achialvbv darminto.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Vbvritola Jisu minto, “Ninyia akinbv kayu tvka! Ogubv nonu ninyia mindwkminku yadunv? Nw ngam alvnvgo okv kaapu rungnvgo rijipv. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Nonu aludwkia heemanv nyi vdwa lvkobv ribam tvdu, okv vdw dw lo mvngridw, nonu ho bunua ridurladu. Vbvritola nonu nga aludwkia lvkobv doobam paamare. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Nw ogugo rila pvdw nw rigvnyibv; Nw nampunvnga ngoogv ayaklo piaknam si ngam nyibung riidwlo rise nga riicho dunv. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Vjak, ngo nonua jvjvbv mindu, ogoloka ho Gamlv nga nyiamooku mvnwng so japgo redw, ninyigv rinamsum, ninyia mvngpala minpa nvnv gobv ribwngre.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Judas koa dukubv tolwk toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mt 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Vbvrikunamv Judas Iskeriot, lvbwlaksu vring gola anyi lokv akonv, nyibu butv vdwgvlo Jisunyi bunu gvlo koa lwkdubv vla vngtoku. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Bunu ninyigv minam ha tvvla mvngpu nyatoku, okv ninyia morko jidubv milv nyato. Vkvlvgabv Judas Jisunyi bunu gvlo laklwkdubv alvnv dw makarto.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv vngbo dvmin dvbam toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mt 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Lk 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Vpap lwkmabv vtwng dvdw pumja gv loocho alulo, ho alu vngbodvnam lvgabv svlarkuu nga mvki toku, Jisu gv lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia tvvkato, “Ogulo no ngonua vngbodvnam dvmin nama noogv lvgabv richola ripv tebv vngnyika mvngdunv?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu bunugv lokv anyi gonyi svbv milwk gvrila vngmuto: “Banggu alo aaika, okv nyi go isi pvchwng joonv go nonua vngrwksire. Ninyia vngming gvla <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>ninyia naam arwng aaming gvlaka, okv naam atua minlaka: ‘Tamsarnv mindu, ngo la okv ngoogv lvbwlaksu vdwv vngbodvnam dvjiku karchung ngv ogolola?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Vbvrikunamv nw nonua aolo kairungnv karchung go kaapubv okv mvdum ridumla pvvnamgo kaatamre, hoka nonu ngonu gvbv ogumvnwng nga mvpvripv nama paare.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv vngrapla, okv banggu lo vngtoku, okv Jisu gv bunua mingkunam aingbv ogumvnwng nga paatoku; okv bunu vngbodvnam ha mvpvripv toku.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Vdwlo arium tokudw, Jisu lvbwlaksu vring gola anyia lvkobv aatoku. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Bunu tvbul lo dvbamla doorilo, Jisu minto, “Ngo nonua mindu, nonu lokv akonv ngam koare—ho angv nga lvkobv dvbamdu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv mvngru toku okv ninyia tvvka rapto akonv kochingbv akonv, “Jvjvbv no nga mima dvbvre, no midunvre?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Hv nonu vring gola anyi lokv akonv yvv ngam lvkobv pwrw lo ninyigv vtwng nga nwkbok minggvnv. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Nyia kuunyilo ngv Darwknv Kitaplo nw vbvrire vnam aingbv rila sire; Vbvritola nyia kuunyilo nga koanv nyi hv vdwgo mvnglv manam mvngru hiru gobv rirekudw! So nyi so gv lvgabv alvyajibvnyi ninyia bvnglin manv guilo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ahtu gv Dvtardvnya dvgvnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mt 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Bunugv dvla doorilo, Jisu vtwng alap go naato, umbonyikv vla kumto, um pimwkto, okv um ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa jitoku. Nw minto, “Sum naatoka si ngoogv ayak hv,”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Vbvrikunamv nw koobu a naata toku Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vto, okv um bunua laklwk toku; okv um bunu mvnwngngv tvngbam toku. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Jisu minto, “Si ngoogv oyi hv, mvnwng gv lvgabv sarlin pvnv, ngoogv oyi hv Pwknvyarnv gv mingkimiyak nama miu pvvnam hv. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Ngo nonua mindu, ngo so gv anggor ala sum vdwloka tvngku mare vdwlo Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo sum anw bv tvngma dvdvlo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu miriminpak go minto kula okv Olib moodw bv vnglin nyatoku.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pitar gv mvvse nga mincho jitoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mt 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Jisu bunuam minto, “Nonu mvnwngngv ngam kayupila kireku, Darwknv Kitap hv mindu, Pwknvyarnv mvkire svlar kaaya nvnga, okv svlar mvnwng hv kiyak karriku. <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Vbvritola ngoogv turkurro kochingbv, ngo Galili lo nonua vngchoyare.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Pitar mirwkto, “Mvnwngngv vbv risujeka, ngo nam vdwloka kiyumare!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Jisu Pitarnyi minto, “Ngo nam mindunv, siyu gv ayulo rokpu hv lvnyi go kokma dwbv ho no ngam chimapvnv vla lvom go minre.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Pitar abuyabv atorla mirwkto, “Ngo nam lvkobv sidajeka, vdwloka ngo vbv mimare!” Okv kvvbi lvbwlaksu mvnwng vka lvkobv vbv mintoku.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Getsemane lo kumtoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mt 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Bunu Getsemane vnam mooku lo aalwkto, okv Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Ngoogv kumrinyi soka dooyato.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Jisu Pitar, jems, okv Jonnyi lvkobv vnggv linto. Achialvbv mvngdwk okv sakdwk kv ninyi gvlo aalwk toku, <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>okv nw bunuam minto, “Ngoogv haapok so gv mvngdwk v achialvbv kaiyajvla v nga cheloyanga mvdup duku. So dooyato okv kaayato.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Jisu achuk gobv adu vngto, nw atubongv kvdwlo gipvto, okv vbv kumto, rinyubolo, nw hindarkasu hinkulo vngmadubv vla. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Nw kumto “Abua” “Ngoogv Abua! No gvbv ogumvnwng nga rinyudo. Mvngdwk gv koobu sam ngoogv lokv naapak labv. Vbvjvka ngoogv mvngnam bvma, vbvritola noogv mvngnam bvka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Vbvrikunamv nw linkurto okv lvbwlaksu aoma yupngakla doodubv kaapato. Nw Pitarnyi minto, “Saimon, no yupdu nvri? Nonu gunta akin gv lvgabvka hula doonyu mai?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Okv nw bunua minto, “Hula doobwngto, okv nonu v ho pookayarka lo gilu madubv kumtoka. Dow hv alvnvnga rinwngdu vbvritola adwn hv nyakriadu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Nw lvkodv vngdvla okv kumtoku, minam akin gaam a minbwngto. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Vbvrikunamv nw lvbwlaksu vdwlo aakur toku okv bunuam yupdubv kaapato; bunugv nyik hv nyiktarla bunu doonyu mato. Okv bunu chima toku ninyia ogugo mirwk svngvdw.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Nw vdwlo lvom nvnv bv aakur dvto, nw bunua mintoku. “Nonu vjak gudvbv yupdvla okv doomin nyaduai? Hv kubvcho! Kaatoka Nyia Kuunyilo a rimurnv nyi vdwgv laak lo laklwkdw v aadukunv! <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Godung to, klai ngonu vnglaju. Kaatoka, siinv yvvdw nga koanv nyi angv!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi naatung kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mt 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Vdwlo Jisu gv gaam mindung dvdubv vring gola anyi lvbwlaksu lokv akonv Judas, aachitoku. Nw gv aakulo lvkobv nyibu butv vdwgv, Pvbv tamsarnv vdwgv okv nyiga vdwgv kanamla vngmunam vkv riokse, okv daadwng bvngnv nyitwng go aaming gvto. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Koanv nyitwng nga riring rima go mirwjito. “Ngo yvvnyi mopup redw hv nonugv naajinam nyi angvla. Nw ha naatung laka okv ninyia kaaria kolo boolwkla vnggvlaka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Judas aachi sopikda, nw Jisu gvlo aato okv minto, “Tamsarnv!” Okv ninyia moopupto. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu Jisunyi naatung toku okv ninyia laak ha achialvbv gakbwng toku. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Vbvritola hoka daknv nyi akonv atugv riokse nga svlin gvrila okv Nyibu Butvyachok gv pakbua nvnglinla nyarung ha paluto. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu minrap lakula okv bunua minto, “Nonu riokse okv daadwng gv lvkobv aala nga naatung dubv ripv ai, ngam Pvbv agumlo rinv aingbv? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Ngo alu gv dwkibv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo nonuam tamsarla rito, okv nonuno nga naatung mato. Vbvritola Darwknv Kitap gv minam hv jvjvbv aarungre.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Vbvrikunamv lvbwlaksu mvnwngngv ninyia kayupila okv adubv kitoku.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Nyi yaapa rungnvgo, vji pakria gvnvgo, Jisu gv kochinglo vngming gvto. Nw ha bunu naatung tvvto, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>vbvritola nw vji ha adarlo kayupila ayak abinbv kiyu toku.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kvbadopam lo daklin toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mt 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Jn 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisunyi Nyibu Butvyachok gv naam lo aagv toku, hoka nyibu butvnv vdwv, nyiga vdwv, okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv doopam nyato. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Pitar adu bv vngming gvto okv nyibu Butvyachok gv naam gv pvrvlo aaming gvto. Nw atu v hoka agi dakrianv vdwa lvkobv, vmv yigu mingvla dooto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Nyibu butv vdwv okv dookumnv mvnwng hv rikw nyato Jisunyi mingging nvnv malinla ninyia mvkinvdubv, vbvritola bunu ogugoka malin nyumato. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Achialvnv mvvnam vkv Jisunyi minv nyato. Vbvritola bunugv minam hv lvin akin mato.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Vbvrikunamv nyi kvgonv dakrapla okv so mvvnam gaam sum Jisu gvlo milwkto: <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Ngonu ninyia vbv mindubv tvvto ‘Ngo nyi gv mvnam Pwknvyarnvnaam sum mvyakre, okv alu loum kochinglo ngo ho nyi gv mvmanam ako mvre.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Bunu mvngchikma, vbvrijvka, bunugv minam ha lvin akin dubv minyu mato.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Nyibu Butvyachoknv mvnwng gv kaagialo dakrapla okv Jisunyi tvuto, “Bunu mvnwng gv nam gungnying lwknam ha no ogu mirwk sise kaama lare?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Vbvritola Jisu sudu mato okv gamgoka milin mato. Lvkodv nyibu Butvyachoknv Jisunyi tvuto, “No Kristo rungre, Ngonugv kumnamjonam Pwknvyarnv gv kuunyilo vrungre?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref> </char>
    </note>“Vm Ngo mabv,” Jisu mirwkto “Okv Nyia Kuunyilo ngam kainv Pwknvyarnv gv lakbiklo doodubv okv nyidomooku tolokv doomwk lo aadu bv nonu mvnwngngv kaapare!”<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Nyibu Butvyachoknv atugv vji ha putak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vji putakpuyak nam si achialvbv sakchala mvngrunam Jius ridung vngdung lo.</char></note> puyak sito okv minto, “Ngonu so gv aolo kvvbi tvvlakaala minjinv yago dinchi kuma! <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Nonu ninyigv Pwknvyarnvnyi nyarjitari nama tvvgvnyibv. Nonugv minbwk svngv ogugola?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Bunu mvnwngngv ninyia tokum lwktoku: nw rimur rungpv sirung dubv ripv.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Bunu kvgonv Jisunyi tachor chorbiak rapto, okv bunu Jisu gv nyik a putumto okv ninyia nwkto. “Minjwk kaato yvvla nam nwkbu hv!” Bunu minto. Okv dakrianv vdwv ninyia svbiak svriakto okv ninyia vnggv toku.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar Jisunyi chimakv vkunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mt 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jn 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Vdwlo Nyibu Butvyachok gv nyijar paknv vdwlokv akonv aalwkrilo Pitar vjaklodvbv pvrvlo doodvto. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Vdwlo hv Pitarnyi vmvlo atubongv yigula doodubv kaapa pvdw, hv ninyia kadichinchila kaato okv minto, “No kai Najareth Jisu gv lvkobv rinvgo ai.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Vbvritola nw um mvvtoku. “Ngo chima... No ogugo mindunv ngo tvvchinma,” nw mirwksito, okv nw aagia gv agi dookubv vngyi toku. Vbvrikunamv vjakpi gubv rokpu ako koktoku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo doomado</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vjakpi gobv rokpu ako kokto. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Paknv nyijar angv ninyia hoka kaatola okv kaala daknv vdwa mindvjito, “Nw bunugv lokv akonv!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Vbvritola Pitar lvkodv um mvvdvto. Achakgu ayungjvma nga dakbam vdwv Pitarnyi gungnying milwkto, “No mvvnyu mare ho bunugv lokv ako nvngvma vla, ogulvgavbolo no ka, Galili lokv mabv.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Vbvrikunamv Pitar minto, “Ngo atubongv jvjvbv ho milv sidunv! Ngo jvjvbv minma dvnvlo Pwknvyarnv ngam mvrit laka! Nonu yvvnyi mindunv ho nyi anga ngo chima!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Vbv minam gola rokpu hv lvnyi nvbv kokto, okv Pitar Jisu ogugo ninyia minpvkudw mvngpa toku, “Rokpu hv lvnyi go kokma dwbv ho no lvom go nga chima vla minre.” Okv nw mvngdwk hv mvngtung sinyu kumabv rila kaptoku.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Pilot gvlo boolwk kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mt 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Arukamchi bv nyibu butvnv vdwv, baapubv nyiga vdwa, Pvbv tamsarnv vdwa, okv dookum mvnwngnga lvkobv kaarwksuto. Okv bunugv rungnam vdwa mvtoku. Bunu Jisunyi jaako lvktola, ninyia vnglin gvto, okv Pilot gvlo ninyia laklwk toku. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilot ninyia tvuto, “No Jius vdwgv Dvbv ngvri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jisu mirwkto “No gv minam v mabv.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Nyibu butvnv vdwv Jisu gvlo gungnying awgo milwkto, <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>vkvlvgabv Pilot Jisunyi tvvdidvto “No mirwk dubv mvngmare? Tvvtoka vdwgo bunu mvnwngngv nam gungnying lwkdunv!”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Lvkodv Jisu gamgoka mirwk sumato, okv Pilot mvngngak pala mvngtoku.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi simu dukubv minkunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mt 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Vngbodvnam Pumja ngv rirap dwkibv Pilot gvlo vkvnv ribwng namgo dooto patwklo tumnam nyi vdwlokv akonyi nyi vdwgv koonam anga anyubv limu dukubv. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Vbvriri ho nyi ako aminv Barabas vnam gonyi vdwa yalung dula gwngrw gwnv go patwk arwnglo dooto. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Vdwlo nyitwng ngv vngkum tokudw okv bunu Pilot ninyigv ribu ha rijilabv vla kooto. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Nw bunua tvvkato, “Nonu ngam jius gv Dvbv nga nonugv lvgabv anyubv topu jilabv vla mvngdure?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Bunugv tanyum gvnam lokv nyibu butv vdwv Jisunyi ninyi gvlo laklwk dunv vla Pilot alvrungbv chinto.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Vbvritola nyibu butvnv vdwv nyitwng nga bunugv lvgabv Barabasnyi anyubv tulin jilabv vla Pilotnyi mintokv vla miarto. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilot nyitwng nga lvkodv tvvkato, “Vbvrikunamv, nonugv Jius vdwgv dvbv ngv, vnam nyi sum ngam ogu ritokv vla mvngdu?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Bunu rumla gokorto, “Ninyia Daapolo takki toka!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilot tvvka tokuda, “Vbvritola ogunv rimur gula nw ripvnv?” Bunu abuyabv rumla gokto “Ninyia Daapolo takki toka.”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilot nyitwng nga rinyok dubv mvngto, vkvlvgabv nw bunu gvbv Barabasnyi anyubv tulin jitoku. Vbvrikunamv Pilot Jisunyi svnyak pamutoku, okv bunugv laaklo ninyia daapo lo takki dukubv jilwk toku.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sipai vdwv Jisunyi nyarjikau toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mt 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Jn 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Sipai vdwv bunugv ajin vdwa gokkum silaila Jisunyi Pilot nyigam gv kvba baaku pvrvlo vnggvtoku. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Bunu lvngching lwngbonv vji vkv jvtvlaklwk gubv Jisunyi pilwkto, tvv doonv hakbv lokv dunggar bv mvto, okv um ninyigv dumpo lo pilwkto. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu salaam mvminto: “Jius vdwgv Dvbv ngv turbwng laka!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Bunu ninyigv dumpo nga daadwng lokv dvngto, ninyia tachor chorke toku. Ninyia bunu lvbwng ngv kumpvto, okv guplwkto. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Vdwlo bunu ninyia rijirio svngam rinya tokudw, bunu ninyigv ayak lokv lvngching lwngbonv vji pilwk nama pilintoku okv ninyigv vji gvbwng nama pikkur lwktoku. Vbvrikunamv bunu ninyia daapolo takki dubv linggv toku.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Daapo lo takki kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mt 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lamtvlo bunu nyi go aminv Saimon vnamgo vngrwk suto nw mooku lokv pamtv bv aanvgo, okv ninyia sipai vdwv Jisu gv Daapo ngam joodu bv mililalato. (Saimon nw Sairene lokv okv Alekjandar gvla Rupus gv abuv.) <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Bunu Jisunyi Golgota vnam mooku lo aalwk gvto. “Golgota vnam si dumku gv mooku.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Hoka bunu ninyia anggor ala lo nvnv mvyomvchinam miir vnam, vkv jitv tvvto, vbvritola Jisu um tvngmato. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Miri 22:18</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv bunu ninyia hoka daapolo takki toku okv ninyigv vji ha bunu mvnwng hv ormi sitoku, vji arip ha yvv paaridw vla kaakanvbv vlwng lika suto. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Vdwlo ninyia bunu Daapolo takki rilo ho aru gv gunta kiya baji bv ritoku. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Ninyia gungnying lwgvnvnv nga “Jius vdwgv Dvbv” vla lvktola kaapadubv timpvto. <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Bunu dvritnaaritnv nyi anyi goka Jisunyi lvkobv akonyi lakbik kyambv okv akonyi lakchi kyambv takkito.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo bars 28 sum lvktamdo: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngo nonua mindunv Darwknv Kitaplo mindu, ‘Nw rimur nvgv gungnying nga gvvria jito,’ vnam ngoogv lvga ngv jvjvbv aarung reku”</char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Kaato Lk 22.37). </char></note> [<verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Aij 53:12</ref></char></note>Vkv aingbv Darwknv Kitap hv jvjvbv ritoku ho mindu “Nw alvmanv nyi vdwgv aje ha naapin sipv”] <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Aij 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Miri 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jn 2:19</ref></char>
    </note>Lamtv lokv vngpiknv nyi vdwv dumpo ngv dumpv panyula riying dvla Jisunyi minjimiobv svbv minto, “Ah ha! No Pwknvyarnvnaam ha mvyak gvrila alu loum lo mvrung tvdukui! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Vjak Daapo hokv itokuka okv no atu hv mvtursito kuka!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Vbvdvdvbv nyibu butvnv vdwv okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv, Jisunyi nyarji minto, bunu mimisito, “Nw kvvbi vdwa ringlato, vbvritola nw atu hv ringsu-nyuma! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Klai kaalaju Kristonyi, Israel gv Dvbvnyi, vjak Daapo lokv idu kubv, ho ngonu ninyia mvngjwng rikunv!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Okv ninyia takulo taktanam nyi anyi vka Jisunyi minjimiola mindvto.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv sikunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mt 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Vdwlo alu lopo tokudw, mooku mvnwnglo kanv toku, v gunta aom gubv doobwngto. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Miri 22:1</ref></char></note>Gunta aom baji bv Jisu gamtv rungbv gokla minto “Eloi, Eloi, lama Sabakthani?” So vnam si “Ngoogv Pwknvyarnv, ngoogv Pwknvyarnv no ogu bv ngam topak duku nvla?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Nyi mego hoka doonv vdwv ninyigv minam um tvgvrila minto, “Tvvtoka nw Elijanyi gokdu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Bunugv lokv akonv riolwkto tachak pupam go bvngla, um kungsoknv opolo nwkbokto, okv um singda nyiktoklo pubwngto. Vbvritola nw um Jisugv naptwng naborlo tungsala tungpvto okv minto, “Dooyato! Klai kaalaju lvkonyika Elija aala ninyia Daapo loka naalu ridw!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Gamtv rungbv gokto kula Jisu sitoku.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Pwknvyarnv gv naam arwnglo darwk yachoknv karchung lo vji torchik nvnv ngv mvngring lokv lvtwng lobv taknyi gubv takpinsito. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Sipai nyigam daapo kaagia gv nvchilo daktola, Jisu oguaingbv sipvdw um<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kapkok toku okv sitoku.</char></note> vdwlo kaatodw nw svbv minto, “Si Nyi si jvjvbv Pwknvyarnv gv kuunyilo gurung!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:40,41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Lk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref> </char>
    </note> Hoka nyimvmvvga vkv mego, adu lokv kaatinla dakto. Hv bunu Meri Magdalene, boruya Jems gvla Josep gv anv Meri okv Salom. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Bunu Jisu gv Galili lo rerilo remin gvnv ngv okv ninyia ridur nvngv. Okv ninyia vngming gvla Jerusalem lo vngming gvnv nyimvmvvga vkvsin awgo rito.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi nyibung riikunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43"/>Arium dindin bv ritoku, vdwlo Arimatia lokv Josep aalwk todw. Nw Jius kvba vdwgv mvngdvnam nyi gubv rito, nw Pwknvyarnv gv Karv gv aase nga dooya nvgo. Ho alu hv Richo minchola ridw alu bv rito (Vnamsi Jius Doonualu ham loochoyanv), vkvlvgabv Josep mvngrwla Pilot gv dookulo aala Jisu gv svma nga kooto. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Jisu sipvku vnam ha tvvtola Pilot achialvbv lamtoku. Nw sipai nyigamnyi gokla okv Jisu kajo sirokuri vla tvvkato. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Sipai nyigam gvlo tvgapro kochingbv, Pilot Josepnyi svma nga naala duku vla minto. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Josep vji jebor go rvvgv rila, svma nga naalu laku, vji jebor hv tumgv rikula, okv nyibung arwnglo vvpv toku, nyibung ngv vlwng lvngtak golo dulwknam go. Vbv mvgvrila nw agi a vlwng pwktv rungnvgo ngortum to. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Meri Magdalene okv Josep gv anv Meri bunu kaariala okv Jisu gv svma nga vvpv konga kaatoku.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Turkurkunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mt 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Jius Doonualuv vngro kochingbv, Meri Magdalene, Jemsgv anv Meri, okv Salom bunu Jisu gv svma lo piakdubv vla amok nampunv vkv rvvtoku. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Vjwng alu gv achialv arukamchi bv, doonyi chaalin dukubv, bunu nyibung lo vngto. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3-4"/>Bunu lamtvlo akin akin v raami sila vngto, “Yvvkudw ngonugv lvgabv nyibung agi gv vlwng a ngorkok jijinv?” (Ho vlwng angv maatarbv pwktv nvgo.) Vbvrikunamv bunu kaadung namv vlwng ngv ngorkokla doodubv kaapato. <verse eid="MRK 16:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu nyibung arwnglo aato, hoka bunu nyi yaapa go yapungnv vji gvnvgo lakbik kyambv doodubv kaapato, ho bunu lamla busuto.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Nw minto, “Lamla busu mabv” “Ngo chindu nonu Najaret lokv Jisunyi makardu, yvvnyi daapo lo takki nama. Nw so dooma—nw turkur roku! Kaatoka bunugv ninyia vvpv konga. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mt 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mk 14:28</ref> </char></note> Vjak vngyikula okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwam, Pitarnyi mintala bunua so doin sam minji tekuka: ‘Nw Galili lo nonua vngchoyare; ninyigv nonuam mintam kunam aingbv, nonu ninyia alo kaarwk sire.’”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu achialvbv mvngdwkla okv lamla nyibung lokv jokla kula vnglintoku. Bunu yvvnyika ogugo mimato, ogulvgavbolo bunu busu nyato.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">GAMLV NGA AKU BV LVKNYA NAMGO<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mgonv kitap lo krim gv lvknam lo Galv lo so lvktarlvknya namv (bars 9-20 vdw si) doomado</char></note></para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Jisu Meri Magdalenenyi kaatam sutoku</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mt 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Jn 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Jisu gv sitokula turkurro kochingbv Vjwng alu gv arukamchi bv, nw Meri Magdalenenyi kaatam sichoto, ninyigv uyuvram kanw go charlin kunam anga. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Nw vngtoku okv mvngdwkla kapla rila doonv Jisu ninyigv lvkobv rigvnam bunu vdwa mintam jitoku. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Bunu Jisu turpvku okv nw Jisunyi kaarwksuto vnam um tvvtolaka, bunu hum jvjvbv mvngma nyato.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu lvbwlaksu anyia kaatam sutoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Lk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>So kochingbv, Jisu nyidum anyi gonyi akusubv kaatam sutoku vdwlo bunu bunugv diringmooku lamtvlo vngrilo. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Bunu vngkur toku okv kvvbi vdwa minpa toku vbvrijvka bunu hum tvvjing mato.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu vring gula akin a kaatam sutoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mt 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-12">Jn 20:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Ataranya bvku, Jisu lvbwlaksu vring gola akin gonyi kaatam sutoku bunugv dvnam dvla doorilo. Nw bunua yamtoku ogulvgavbolo bunu gvlo mvngjwng doomato okv ogulvgavbolo bunu achialvbv tvvjing nyuma nvgobv rito yvv bunu ninyia turpv vla kaatola mintam namaka tvvjing mato. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Nyim 1:8</ref> </char></note> Nw bunua mintoku, “Vngnyika nonu nyiamooku mvnwnglo okv Gamlv nga nyi mvnwnglo japji teka. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Yvv bunu mvngjwngla Baptisma naaredw v bunu ringnam a paareku; Okv Yvv bunu mvngjwng maredw bunu ngooriku. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Mvngjwngnv vdwgvlo svkvnv lamrwpabv rigvnvnv jwkrw ngv lvkobv dooming gvriku: Bunu ngoogv amin lokv uyuvram vdwa charpakre; Bunu akusunv gaam japlare; <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Bunu tabw vdwa naarapjeka vmalo chumdwk haka tvngjeka, bunua ogu rimare; bunu nyi lvvmanv aolo laak lakpvbolo lvvmanv poyariku.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi nyidomooku bv naacha kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Nyim 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Nyim 1:9-11</ref> </char>
    </note>Ahtu Jisu gv bunua mintamro kochingbv, ninyia nyidomooku bv naacha toku, okv ninyia Pwknvyarnv gv lakbik kyamlo doomu toku. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv vnglintoku okv mooku mvnwnglo japgo jitoku, okv Ahtu bunua lvkobv reming gvto okv bunugv japji namv jvjv gorung mvngdubv lamrwpadubv rila kaatam jitoku.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
